{"id":"cb804468-f17d-427f-a5fb-53595de42ea5","expr":"pattern == null || str == null || !pattern.isEmpty() || str.isEmpty()","rationale":"At method entry, if pattern or str is null then result will be false due to contract. If both non-null, empty pattern may only match empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:03.612052977Z"}
