{"id":"2195b22e-62c4-4616-b78e-698e021a139c","expr":"namespaceMapping != null","rationale":"The method getNamespaces(namespaceMapping) assumes namespaceMapping is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#startElementInternal(QName,Attributes,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.828498983Z"}
{"id":"9ef9c391-c6e2-4e8b-bd09-524a8d46f639","expr":"namespaceMapping != null","rationale":"Parameter 'namespaceMapping' should not be null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.838647821Z"}
{"id":"9e53f838-fdef-4cea-b4e2-d436e307d7d1","expr":"!namespaceMapping.containsKey(null)","rationale":"The namespaceMapping map should not contain null keys.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.838647821Z"}
{"id":"961501bb-09b2-4b41-932b-33b9042e39a1","expr":"!namespaceMapping.containsValue(null)","rationale":"The namespaceMapping map should not contain null values.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.838647821Z"}
{"id":"b0f71c86-b221-4bfb-b40d-4bef2722a8fc","expr":"name.getNamespaceURI() == null || name.getNamespaceURI().isEmpty() || namespaceMapping.containsValue(name.getNamespaceURI())","rationale":"If there's a namespace URI on the QName, it should be present in namespaceMapping values.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.838647821Z"}
{"id":"731fb0e9-c88a-4a22-8841-07c8826f34af","expr":"data != null && !data.isEmpty()","rationale":"Because the method creates a character event from data, it is likely that data is non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.844326161Z"}
{"id":"21acb552-6098-411a-b736-46a9230149b5","expr":"data.length() > 0","rationale":"Based on the assumption that data is a non-empty string when the method exits.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.844326161Z"}
{"id":"63a66b9f-4449-43d8-ad96-4a114432d4b5","expr":"!data.contains(\"<\") && !data.contains(\">\") && !data.contains(\"&\")","rationale":"The data string likely has no unescaped markup characters at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.844326161Z"}
{"id":"b069b79f-34ab-44df-8f35-0355096cad9a","expr":"data.equals(data.trim())","rationale":"The string data used to create characters is probably trimmed before passing.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.844326161Z"}
{"id":"d5defb7b-bccb-41a1-ae9f-088c05f69aab","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The method is creating XML characters using the data, implying data should not be null to create valid characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.845864388Z"}
{"id":"8255d144-e5c9-4c95-8b8c-0b599894fc4a","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always greater or equal to zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.845864388Z"}
{"id":"11c584e3-cb3c-4102-9f60-61d6b9b84867","expr":"!data.isEmpty() || data.length() == 0","rationale":"String is either empty or not empty, a tautological invariant expressing completeness of isEmpty and length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.845864388Z"}
{"id":"b85e4c42-40dd-424f-a682-8b0426c299d6","expr":"data != null && data.length() >= 0","rationale":"The method uses data immediately in creating CDATA, so data is typically non-null and has a length >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.846780222Z"}
{"id":"33461b42-334c-41a8-a669-00c83deb49b2","expr":"!data.contains(\"]]>\")","rationale":"CDATA sections in XML cannot contain the sequence ']]>', so the data string should not contain it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.846780222Z"}
{"id":"23318952-71df-405e-bc97-fa74c5a2e64f","expr":"result.size() == namespaceMappings.size()","rationale":"The result list size equals the size of the namespaceMappings map.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getNamespaces(Map<String, String>):List<Namespace>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.835876723Z"}
{"id":"b362c9c4-ed5d-4804-98f0-b7ae57ade562","expr":"namespaceMappings.size() >= 0","rationale":"Map size is always >= 0 for a valid Map","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getNamespaces(Map<String, String>):List<Namespace>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.830348826Z"}
{"id":"d10f019b-63d4-4d85-9f8b-915bc5451f91","expr":"data != null && data.trim().length() == 0","rationale":"Because the method creates ignorable space events, the data string should contain only whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.849400255Z"}
{"id":"90745510-5da4-4839-a50c-f6c56a934877","expr":"data.length() > 0","rationale":"The data passed represents whitespace characters that are ignorable, it should not be an empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.849400255Z"}
{"id":"7a512b4b-00bc-4a0b-80b8-8e8b42b17bbc","expr":"target != null && !target.isEmpty()","rationale":"Target should be a valid XML processing instruction target name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.852310364Z"}
{"id":"398d0d6b-0d2f-43f2-9cda-14ca45909484","expr":"!namespaceMappings.isEmpty() || result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If namespaceMappings is empty, result is empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getNamespaces(Map<String, String>):List<Namespace>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.835876723Z"}
{"id":"c747f905-b1a1-42f7-9ca2-414ad15837a8","expr":"data.equals(data.trim())","rationale":"CDATA sections preserve the exact content including whitespace; therefore, data is likely not changed by trimming.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.846780222Z"}
{"id":"7a99a6f9-a116-4653-bc02-bd6787ceeebc","expr":"data != null && data.trim().isEmpty() || !data.trim().isEmpty()","rationale":"data represents whitespace content likely to be ignorable spaces; it is either empty or non-empty whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.847140130Z"}
{"id":"52040519-ab48-4189-8c5b-64cdd9bfb95b","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The method is called with a non-null string representing the whitespace to be handled.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.847140130Z"}
{"id":"acc162e1-bd80-4bd8-be94-06bab285927b","expr":"data == null || !data.isEmpty()","rationale":"Data is either null or contains meaningful data string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.852310364Z"}
{"id":"cdda8848-d7ad-4a42-a9aa-a91516f0cc87","expr":"dtd != null && dtd.length() > 0","rationale":"At method entry, 'dtd' should be a non-null and non-empty string for the createDTD method to function properly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.854426408Z"}
{"id":"81ef304a-b5b1-4c2b-87e9-e6dbf835c602","expr":"dtd == null || !dtd.trim().isEmpty()","rationale":"This invariant captures the possibility that 'dtd' might be null or a non-blank string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.854426408Z"}
{"id":"d1dcc93e-dc59-4a44-bd1c-41beb704c337","expr":"target != null && !target.isEmpty()","rationale":"Processing instruction target strings are usually non-null and non-empty as they are XML targets.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.854149376Z"}
{"id":"ba1d8f42-97da-458c-b636-6d5f1f92e522","expr":"data == null || data.length() >= 0","rationale":"data parameter can be null or any string, with length at least zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.854149376Z"}
{"id":"878a4327-0a80-4339-8371-170564c10b5d","expr":"target != null && target.indexOf(' ') < 0","rationale":"XML processing instruction targets are token strings without spaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.854149376Z"}
{"id":"21989c38-be25-481f-88fe-9832f39162e9","expr":"target != null && target.equals(target.trim())","rationale":"Processing instruction targets typically have no surrounding whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.854149376Z"}
{"id":"90525eea-122a-4532-bef5-1b0372f58157","expr":"data == null || data.equals(data.trim())","rationale":"Data parameter may have no leading or trailing whitespace when non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.854149376Z"}
{"id":"70501027-104c-4e6f-a4eb-ebae1be98677","expr":"data != null && !data.isEmpty()","rationale":"CDATA string should not be empty or null to form valid CDATA section.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.853880069Z"}
{"id":"b311c213-7e3f-46b7-8dba-aab55ba06d7c","expr":"dtd == null || dtd.startsWith(\"<!\")","rationale":"Ensures that when 'dtd' is not null, it likely represents DTD content starting with a declaration marker.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.854426408Z"}
{"id":"87ead9ed-6c51-493a-a7eb-3348c5d6825c","expr":"dtd == null || dtd.endsWith(\">\")","rationale":"Checks that the 'dtd' string, if non-null, ends with a standard DTD closing character.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.854426408Z"}
{"id":"128b0658-b754-49c8-8160-e0138617f4d2","expr":"comment != null && !comment.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method uses comment to create an XML comment, which typically expects a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.864882945Z"}
{"id":"a53067ea-0d77-444d-8a34-eb9ec7668299","expr":"comment == null || comment.matches(\".*\")","rationale":"Given the method signature, comment could be null or any string, so this is a tautology but reflects possible inputs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.864882945Z"}
{"id":"8aad366a-ea05-4144-9c2b-f3d752619ea6","expr":"comment == null || !comment.contains(\"--\")","rationale":"XML comment text must not contain the double hyphen sequence to be valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.864882945Z"}
{"id":"b24628d3-5cea-4c70-88b3-ef3cd412f608","expr":"comment == null || !comment.endsWith(\"-\")","rationale":"Ending a comment with '-' is generally avoided to maintain well-formed XML comments.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.864882945Z"}
{"id":"a9ec4f99-ff5e-430b-9a6b-f444e9d77812","expr":"comment == null || !comment.startsWith(\"-\")","rationale":"Starting a comment with '-' is disallowed in XML comments.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.864882945Z"}
{"id":"56d0650e-1293-4584-b6c3-36480eab70ea","expr":"target != null && !target.contains(\"<?\") && !target.contains(\"?>\")","rationale":"Target should not contain XML processing instruction delimiter substrings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.852310364Z"}
{"id":"2877a36f-209d-43b1-9e77-f2527cc10799","expr":"(data == null) || (data.indexOf('\"') == -1)","rationale":"Data string likely does not contain double quote characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.852310364Z"}
{"id":"a7823d96-cf39-4c96-a87e-540dea6ff165","expr":"target.equals(target.trim())","rationale":"The target string is trimmed and does not have surrounding whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.852310364Z"}
{"id":"2539af95-bbca-4c49-9717-dfdae347fab5","expr":"dtd != null && !dtd.isEmpty()","rationale":"For the createDTD call to be meaningful, the dtd string is likely non-null and has some content.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.857809277Z"}
{"id":"876e521b-df86-4e64-abc3-9b6051c97943","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The method expects non-null data to create a CDATA event.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.853880069Z"}
{"id":"8a3ee27a-c51a-4cdb-850f-4960a962d155","expr":"data.length() <= 65536","rationale":"It's common to expect CDATA sections to be reasonably sized; this invariant limits size.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.853880069Z"}
{"id":"b85117bc-a85a-410b-a4a9-65d6aca5a0d4","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The parameter name is expected to be non-null upon method exit because no modifications occur.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#skippedEntityInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.865704031Z"}
{"id":"b3eb0929-38e2-45a6-95d6-8be8364e5e20","expr":"name.length() >= 0","rationale":"The length of the name string is non-negative, as per String class contract.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#skippedEntityInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.865704031Z"}
{"id":"be8c1dcb-6088-4723-aafd-0c2f889369e1","expr":"comment != null && !comment.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, comments are expected to be non-null and non-empty when creating XML comments.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.865036113Z"}
{"id":"9f5b5d43-bc1a-4caa-9f20-e2f56b729bf6","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Method parameter 'name' is likely required to be non-null for processing skipped entities.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#skippedEntityInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.864955852Z"}
{"id":"62f5dae0-6a1b-4a28-9285-d0589f2ef304","expr":"!name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Entity names typically are not empty strings, so 'name' is expected to have length > 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#skippedEntityInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.864955852Z"}
{"id":"fc432a69-f31d-4a4a-8a25-5a90923c736b","expr":"name.trim().length() == name.length()","rationale":"Entity names generally don't include leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#skippedEntityInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.864955852Z"}
{"id":"8d22a888-004e-4e7b-b938-52838bdd5328","expr":"comment == null || comment.length() < 1000","rationale":"Comments are usually of limited length to prevent very large comment nodes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.865036113Z"}
{"id":"a2a7b30b-d073-41c7-ac1e-1dab05cd6669","expr":"comment == null || !comment.contains(\"--\")","rationale":"XML comments cannot contain double hyphens; enforcing this rule here.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.865036113Z"}
{"id":"268be115-3dc4-4b6c-a38e-84f184195440","expr":"comment == null || comment.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"Comment is either null or non-blank string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.865036113Z"}
{"id":"176dff21-58ac-4490-b59d-335d60db2edb","expr":"result >= 0","rationale":"The line number returned should be non-negative because XML locators generally report lines starting at 1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getLineNumber():int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.872734868Z"}
{"id":"cc82c37d-11ae-4957-8160-bfadd22ed5f2","expr":"result >= 0","rationale":"Column number returned by getColumnNumber() is usually zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getColumnNumber():int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.873909951Z"}
{"id":"0e9f806e-f672-44f2-b92c-2fe74f652d5c","expr":"result == -1","rationale":"The method returns a constant value -1, so result is always -1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getCharacterOffset():int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:04.874619817Z"}
