{"id":"ca72d511-5719-43c7-8c2a-680b3779dd41","expr":"value.equals(value)","rationale":"The value passed to the method equals itself, ensuring no inadvertent modification inside the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeAttribute(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.131810033Z"}
