{"id":"fab34eb1-c4cd-4b06-8f94-5a394b4964c5","expr":"namespace.getPrefix().length() >= 0","rationale":"As a string attribute, prefix length is always non-negative, a trivial but valid invariant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#doWriteNamespace(Namespace):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.154853567Z"}
{"id":"2d107faf-2a0c-4c29-a89f-330213f11fa9","expr":"text != null && !text.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method is called to write characters, so generally 'text' should be non-null and contain some content.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.167853243Z"}
