{"id":"9882df09-392c-43e2-8138-50ef0b22e4c9","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method uses the 'name' parameter; it's likely non-null at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.202199568Z"}
