{"id":"6a27a263-9845-451e-8469-0078b868c5d1","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The data string must be non-null when the method is entered.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.205815707Z"}
