{"id":"1b7607ab-5c72-45d7-a3d3-78e043613fa6","expr":"data != null && !data.isEmpty()","rationale":"At method exit, data is expected to be non-null and non-empty because it's passed to streamWriter.writeCharacters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.211536979Z"}
