{"id":"a92a3676-1712-47da-a429-6bcfc2b43d62","expr":"comment.trim().equals(comment)","rationale":"The comment string probably has no leading or trailing whitespace because XML comments are trimmed or normalized.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.229799432Z"}
{"id":"08dc5864-119b-4db7-a606-a3b25fe2e43f","expr":"locator == null || (locator.getLineNumber() > 0 || locator.getColumnNumber() > 0)","rationale":"The Locator typically provides line and column numbers that are positive integers in XML parsing contexts.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#setDocumentLocator(Locator):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.230494471Z"}
