{"id":"72cfd4a7-0bb3-4523-8654-eb91a562aa2b","expr":"locator == null || locator.getSystemId() == null || !locator.getSystemId().isEmpty()","rationale":"System ID strings represent system URIs and are typically non-empty when present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#setDocumentLocator(Locator):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.230494471Z"}
{"id":"4405700c-1c20-4da0-a3c6-05f1575b4817","expr":"locator == null || locator.getLineNumber() >= -1","rationale":"According to SAX Locator specification, line number can be -1 if unspecified.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#setDocumentLocator(Locator):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.230494471Z"}
