{"id":"1369b6b3-38ee-4f08-9977-87f97308d854","expr":"result.indexOf('<') == -1","rationale":"The method throws if start element encountered in text so '<' should not appear.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getElementText():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.250420467Z"}
{"id":"8d4f7c32-453f-4092-a563-4150c7427fa7","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method is called with a specific entity name, expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.240524715Z"}
