{"id":"926daf4b-e903-471c-b4c2-31731bb64ec5","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"The index parameter represents the attribute position; it is generally non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getAttributeNamespace(int):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.254952689Z"}
