{"id":"5d6faf87-f0cd-4218-b1f5-6b0fc844a64b","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"Attribute indices are generally non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getAttributePrefix(int):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.255519647Z"}
{"id":"0332d4dd-b36b-49c1-a377-d2b7fea30a1b","expr":"result != null && !result.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method returns namespace URI only for START_ELEMENT or END_ELEMENT events, which usually have non-empty namespace URIs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getNamespaceURI():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.263030177Z"}
{"id":"18f7306b-5d79-4128-ad11-4d3a37104761","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method must return a valid namespace URI string, so result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getNamespaceURI():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.263030177Z"}
{"id":"ed52c823-d70d-47e4-9a05-a42e0c81a9b3","expr":"!result.contains(\" \")","rationale":"The returned namespace URI generally has no spaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getNamespaceURI():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.263030177Z"}
{"id":"6fc3969e-3d7e-472e-a1c1-8d07e8e11688","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"The returned namespace URI string is expected to have positive length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getNamespaceURI():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.263030177Z"}
{"id":"42429b0e-3448-461d-ba78-2fc1c6ecf9c5","expr":"result == null || result.length() >= 0","rationale":"The namespace URI string returned is either null or a valid string with zero or more characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getNamespaceURI(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.263916045Z"}
{"id":"e1ee8b88-e7fd-4a38-882a-b73f82a40eba","expr":"prefix != null || result == null","rationale":"If the prefix is null, the method usually returns null for the namespace URI.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getNamespaceURI(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.263916045Z"}
{"id":"e25329c4-f04c-43b9-8e59-d5c3d5155e16","expr":"prefix != null || (result == null || result.isEmpty())","rationale":"When prefix is null, result is either null or empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getNamespaceURI(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.263916045Z"}
{"id":"3d10479c-8899-4220-b3c8-aaf950672a7f","expr":"result != null == (prefix != null)","rationale":"The non-nullness of result corresponds to non-null prefix and its presence in namespace context.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getNamespaceURI(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.263916045Z"}
{"id":"3c6fc794-6a68-4fa8-930e-5f41f32f27fa","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"The parameter 'name' represents the name of an entity, likely a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.240524715Z"}
{"id":"d323785e-ccbd-4e89-8c84-93f0dabc788e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method getAttributeLocalName returns the local part of a QName which is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getAttributeLocalName(int):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.268034459Z"}
{"id":"d6388ad0-a544-401c-9ecb-292ebff5b73c","expr":"!name.contains(\"\\\\0\")","rationale":"Entity names are expected not to include null characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.240524715Z"}
