{"id":"86eb1710-e0e3-4195-8a79-0a4c56868aad","expr":"(qualifiedName.indexOf(':') < qualifiedName.length() - 1) || (qualifiedName.indexOf(':') == -1)","rationale":"The colon index should not be the last character for valid substring calls","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.424414103Z"}
{"id":"52f24d12-88a2-4725-9dd4-452c1bf67832","expr":"result || (qName.getLocalPart().isEmpty() || qName.getPrefix().isEmpty())","rationale":"If the method returns false, then the conditions involving \"xmlns\" prefix/localPart are not satisfied.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.425247583Z"}
{"id":"0fe7af59-9aab-48de-916b-7b4b74f21b91","expr":"result == (!qName.getPrefix().isEmpty() && !qName.getLocalPart().isEmpty()) == false","rationale":"Results depend on whether one of prefix or localPart equals 'xmlns' and corresponding emptiness condition.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.425247583Z"}
{"id":"0dec9172-6a35-45f4-9914-2b11ea647f48","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns an element from a non-empty list this.namespaceMappings, the returned map should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#currentNamespaceMapping():Map<String, String>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.431350192Z"}
