{"id":"dd21e87b-d83c-492a-9fdb-a8097fd65f20","expr":"contentHandler == null || contentHandler.getClass() != null","rationale":"If contentHandler is non-null, calling getClass() is safe and returns non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#setContentHandler(ContentHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.443820250Z"}
{"id":"ffd8a177-4013-4a7c-9049-1ce7f2d81a0e","expr":"name.equals(name.trim())","rationale":"Entity names do not have leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.411291697Z"}
{"id":"0b8dd448-305c-4e7c-855d-099f2425cf17","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The code calls name.startsWith, which requires name to be non-null to avoid NullPointerException at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#getFeature(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:05.452094138Z"}
