{"id":"ed6c1e22-2948-4762-9ac0-18f60be6b3af","expr":"(value == null) == (result == null)","rationale":"The method returns null if and only if the input value is null, ensuring result is null exactly when value is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getDescriptiveType(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.161975162Z"}
