{"id":"affba9ee-cb28-4356-82a7-77e5a040146d","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"Since the class has a qualified name, the short name must have positive length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.182864982Z"}
{"id":"c4e89845-03a8-4a9c-bbdb-4580d6d5e28e","expr":"!result.contains(\".\")","rationale":"The short name does not include package or enclosing class names, so it won't contain '.'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.182864982Z"}
{"id":"2312c7ab-d59d-4aed-9162-18821de836f7","expr":"result.equals(clazz.getSimpleName())","rationale":"The short name is logically the simple class name, so they must match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.182864982Z"}
{"id":"fb80fa69-bf0d-41bc-83fa-c3cafcb8a6ac","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns either clazz or superclass; both are Class objects, never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.170927287Z"}
{"id":"4c9f7576-da74-4eb9-90b2-04a175dbaf64","expr":"(clazz.getName().contains(\"$$\")) || result == clazz","rationale":"If the class name contains CGLIB_CLASS_SEPARATOR, the method returns superclass or clazz; otherwise returns clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.170927287Z"}
