{"id":"8db9a3df-81a2-4a97-b781-287e7b1ea2ff","expr":"clazz.getName().contains(\".\") || !clazz.getName().contains(\".\")","rationale":"The class name string may contain a package separator '.' or may not, valid invariant at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.203253980Z"}
