{"id":"78a2ac63-5023-4d26-aaf9-19096f32bf77","expr":"result != null && !result.isEmpty() && result.equals(clazz.getPackage().getName()) || result.isEmpty() && clazz.getPackage() == null","rationale":"The method returns the package name of the class or empty string if the class has no package.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.213982689Z"}
