{"id":"c282c9fe-6d81-4d92-8fa4-45a27d326895","expr":"clazz != null && methodName != null","rationale":"The method asserts that neither clazz nor methodName is null at the start.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.336502314Z"}
