{"id":"2dcaa52a-511a-47b1-ac5f-fec156af08d6","expr":"!methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Method names are not empty strings as they represent valid method identifiers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.336502314Z"}
{"id":"77189a42-56dc-462c-a93d-31d25b68e57f","expr":"result >= 0","rationale":"Count is incremented for each matching method; hence non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.338583903Z"}
{"id":"da1521ed-d51c-4b15-b518-63d94b5b07c3","expr":"method != null && method.getDeclaringClass() != null && targetClass != method.getDeclaringClass() || targetClass == null","rationale":"Because the method checks for targetClass being non-null and different from method.getDeclaringClass(), an invariant relating those is meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMostSpecificMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.351499399Z"}
