{"id":"8f978df1-6545-4dc6-9868-d4ed8231b092","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Method name is always non-null for Java reflection Method object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMostSpecificMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.351499399Z"}
{"id":"33e3e14c-1e2d-45d8-ac51-5ae0f15edb43","expr":"targetClass == null || method.getDeclaringClass() != targetClass","rationale":"Directly reflects one of the initial conditional checks on targetClass and method's declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMostSpecificMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.351499399Z"}
{"id":"f6cdcb6e-cabb-4085-a7c2-a8bc5be2f795","expr":"!result || clazz.getDeclaredMethods().length > 0 || clazz.getInterfaces().length > 0 || clazz.getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"If the method returns true, the class or its hierarchy must have at least one relevant method or parent.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasAtLeastOneMethodWithName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:08.362561867Z"}
