{"id":"65c39f99-5895-4905-ae6d-be1e25ea0e84","expr":"!className.contains(\" \")","rationale":"In Java, valid class names don't contain spaces, so this is a plausible constraint.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#match(String,MetadataReaderFactory):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.515592228Z"}
{"id":"5321b2d5-514f-424d-9636-eb1b332f30a8","expr":"className.contains(\".\")","rationale":"The method likely receives fully qualified class names, which include at least one '.' separator.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#match(String,MetadataReaderFactory):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.515592228Z"}
{"id":"169215a3-0b59-4bb3-b30b-fb70f47bef2f","expr":"result == true || result == false","rationale":"Result is a boolean value, so always either true or false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#match(String,MetadataReaderFactory):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.513221043Z"}
{"id":"f9f981e2-e1b5-4140-9fc1-2d97905cf874","expr":"className.equals(metadataReaderFactory.getMetadataReader(className).getClassMetadata().getClassName()) || !result","rationale":"If the method returned true, the className corresponds to the metadata class name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#match(String,MetadataReaderFactory):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.513221043Z"}
{"id":"00a63591-218e-4a0d-8834-e5362e5e5af8","expr":"superClassName != null && !superClassName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The parameter superClassName is likely intended to be a valid class name string, which generally should be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#matchSuperClass(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.518037962Z"}
{"id":"d675c8be-4b42-4cb6-bcc5-849082618767","expr":"superClassName != null && superClassName.equals(superClassName)","rationale":"Since superClassName is a String parameter, it should be equal to itself unless null, ensuring it's a valid object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#matchSuperClass(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.518037962Z"}
{"id":"98f5888b-7f56-4908-a755-af61406f2d8f","expr":"superClassName != null && superClassName.length() > 0","rationale":"The method likely expects superClassName to have some length, indicating a meaningful class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#matchSuperClass(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.518037962Z"}
{"id":"3f4d4ed4-354a-4e4f-b5df-1c0b43ad280b","expr":"superClassName != null && Character.isUpperCase(superClassName.charAt(0))","rationale":"By convention, Java class names start with an uppercase letter. This predicate checks that.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#matchSuperClass(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.518037962Z"}
{"id":"6ef0e6d7-6b4f-448d-bd7f-cf89d90d52f4","expr":"superClassName != null && !superClassName.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Java class names generally do not contain spaces, so this condition asserts that superClassName is a valid identifier segment.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#matchSuperClass(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.518037962Z"}
{"id":"9b72ed40-bd0b-4ac0-910f-986fc12bee0f","expr":"interfaceName == null || interfaceName.isEmpty() || interfaceName.length() > 0","rationale":"String is either empty or non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#matchInterface(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.517667665Z"}
{"id":"9a17b494-c818-409a-932c-f922d2c31d21","expr":"metadataReader != null && metadataReaderFactory != null","rationale":"The method requires both metadataReader and metadataReaderFactory to be non-null to perform its logic.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#match(MetadataReader,MetadataReaderFactory):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.517848536Z"}
{"id":"81412f6e-fc50-4823-8160-30dc13ba9d9f","expr":"metadataReader.getClassMetadata() != null","rationale":"MetadataReader's getClassMetadata() is expected to return non-null since matching is based on class metadata.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#match(MetadataReader,MetadataReaderFactory):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.517848536Z"}
{"id":"986846ce-b4db-4768-9a1d-6e3bd0dc44ca","expr":"metadataReader.getClassMetadata().getClassName() != null","rationale":"Class name is required to proceed with matching logic, so it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#match(MetadataReader,MetadataReaderFactory):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.517848536Z"}
{"id":"4d3f2df7-0f24-4056-bb47-0f45aab6e740","expr":"superClassName != null && !superClassName.isEmpty()","rationale":"SuperClassName should be a non-null, non-empty string representing a superclass name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchSuperClass(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.520638318Z"}
{"id":"df37a6fd-a0b5-4d87-b293-d2e2618414e2","expr":"superClassName.equals(superClassName.trim())","rationale":"Ensures the superclass name has no extraneous whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchSuperClass(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.520638318Z"}
{"id":"f9e91b9e-8934-4fcb-ba74-63afc80114b3","expr":"!superClassName.contains(\"$\")","rationale":"Ensuring superClassName is likely a top-level or normal class name, not an inner class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchSuperClass(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.520638318Z"}
{"id":"f996a7cc-698c-4c88-8afc-5dba3a792590","expr":"interfaceName == null || interfaceName.equals(interfaceName)","rationale":"interfaceName equals itself, a trivial but valid invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter#matchInterface(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AbstractTypeHierarchyTraversingFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.517667665Z"}
{"id":"2bca5e55-6792-4a27-b3bd-08bff5787adc","expr":"result == null || (superClassName != null && superClassName.length() > 0)","rationale":"When the result is non-null, the parameter superClassName is expected to be a valid non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchSuperClass(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.521475765Z"}
{"id":"ced54f6e-82af-440c-834f-17ca6e38b08a","expr":"className != null && className.length() > 0","rationale":"className should not be null or empty since it's used in equals comparison.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.519646270Z"}
{"id":"d5c385f1-33c3-4921-ae00-0ad6fde87389","expr":"className.equals(className.trim())","rationale":"Class names typically do not have leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.519646270Z"}
{"id":"0c0f81de-4253-4d99-9763-55b4b8e1b740","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns this.targetType which should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#getTargetType():Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.518693597Z"}
