{"id":"27b60f38-b84e-410d-a774-8ef10d71b2d4","expr":"typeName != null && !typeName.isEmpty()","rationale":"It is plausible that matchTargetType is only called with non-null, non-empty strings representing type names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchTargetType(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.522956082Z"}
{"id":"22e58637-a5bf-4899-ba7c-d7c3005a81a7","expr":"typeName != null","rationale":"null check ensures safe usage of methods equals and startsWith on typeName","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchTargetType(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.522956082Z"}
{"id":"2db882b2-305e-4dfe-a9dd-a1275a5607da","expr":"className.indexOf('.') >= 0","rationale":"Class names for assignment checks often include package prefixes, hence at least one dot.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.519646270Z"}
{"id":"a5664887-e90f-4dde-a6e2-b0064a6e5fa9","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The return value result should not be null since matchTargetType presumably returns a Boolean value.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchInterface(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.521866480Z"}
{"id":"3d1843e0-d916-4729-b202-a922d66d6627","expr":"(interfaceName != null) == (result != null)","rationale":"If interfaceName is null, the match can be false or null, but since the method returns matchTargetType(interfaceName), their nullness is related.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchInterface(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.521866480Z"}
