{"id":"2aa0db79-7a9d-478a-a929-98b2748e2273","expr":"interfaceName != null","rationale":"At method entry, interfaceName is likely expected to be non-null as it is passed to matchTargetType.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchInterface(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.521605319Z"}
{"id":"c65515a1-246c-4289-85bb-1d50ecf777c9","expr":"interfaceName.length() > 0","rationale":"Typically, interface names are non-empty strings, so interfaceName is likely not empty at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchInterface(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.521605319Z"}
{"id":"754e5dd5-ba99-4742-8477-585300270676","expr":"interfaceName.equals(interfaceName.trim())","rationale":"The interfaceName is likely well-formed without extra spaces at the start or end.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.type.filter.AssignableTypeFilter#matchInterface(String):Boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/filter/AssignableTypeFilter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.521605319Z"}
{"id":"db213b98-6973-4137-a4dd-48a933c35a4a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Ensures that the returned result is not null, since the field mergedAnnotations is expected to be initialized.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.type.StandardAnnotationMetadata#getAnnotations():MergedAnnotations","file":"org/springframework/core/type/StandardAnnotationMetadata.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.531594927Z"}
