{"id":"6ffc078d-a8e6-488e-b486-cd019c650812","expr":"result == null","rationale":"Since the method always throws ex, no valid result can be produced, thus result is effectively always null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.ConfigurableObjectInputStream#resolveFallbackIfPossible(String,ClassNotFoundException):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/core/ConfigurableObjectInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.572172564Z"}
{"id":"a6159e60-aad0-4118-8851-bea4d6eda7f5","expr":"className != null && !className.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method aims to resolve a class by name, so className is expected to be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.ConfigurableObjectInputStream#resolveFallbackIfPossible(String,ClassNotFoundException):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/core/ConfigurableObjectInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.579184867Z"}
