{"id":"cb61bdc0-2e33-4c15-af4b-3a7c3cc9f0ff","expr":"buffer.length() > 0","rationale":"The buffer is always appended with at least '[' at this point in the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleStart(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.580600602Z"}
