{"id":"38c89ac1-7959-4cab-9b40-39f4ec10787d","expr":"buffer.length() >= 0","rationale":"StringBuilder length is zero or more before method execution; no prior modification guaranteed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.581522267Z"}
{"id":"539b327b-76a0-418a-9bbd-1b79affc497e","expr":"value == null || value.getClass() != null","rationale":"Ensures value's class can be obtained if it is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.581522267Z"}
{"id":"7159aa9c-b5f7-497d-9eda-5ff939f2e0df","expr":"buffer.length() > 0","rationale":"Buffer is appended with the styled field name and value, so it should be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.582583686Z"}
{"id":"33ffd0cb-ec82-49ee-8c71-3382e68f0981","expr":"fieldName != null","rationale":"Method is using fieldName to styleFieldStart and styleFieldEnd, so fieldName should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.582583686Z"}
{"id":"577cf26b-06a5-4530-94d4-ba88a523bfce","expr":"!fieldName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The field name should not be empty to produce meaningful output.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.582583686Z"}
{"id":"4b13cae7-ae7b-49ee-b289-9070b28bed2c","expr":"buffer.charAt(0) == '[' || buffer.charAt(buffer.length() - 1) == ']'","rationale":"Buffer content is typically enclosed in square brackets after styling the field.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.582583686Z"}
{"id":"0eb440b3-18da-43d5-865b-b7a64719e0be","expr":"buffer != null && obj != null","rationale":"The method appends to buffer and uses obj, so both should be non-null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.580907510Z"}
{"id":"6a17454f-c0a4-4b37-a563-15bfc38e3ba0","expr":"buffer.length() >= 0","rationale":"The length of a StringBuilder is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.580907510Z"}
{"id":"1c11eeed-05c8-4ab8-a617-38a872f3278d","expr":"!buffer.toString().contains(\"@\") || buffer.toString().lastIndexOf('@') < buffer.length()","rationale":"The method appends '@' to the buffer; this checks buffer state before this append.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.580907510Z"}
