{"id":"7be19790-0d1a-4740-b65d-54f257c2bb92","expr":"buffer.length() > 0","rationale":"The method appends ']' to buffer, so buffer length must be positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.583682675Z"}
{"id":"13a187d5-f24e-41c6-8ef8-12ca91027748","expr":"buffer.charAt(buffer.length() - 1) == ']'","rationale":"The method appends ']' to buffer at method exit, so the last char must be ']'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.583682675Z"}
{"id":"b2522c8e-e328-407b-b60b-d2bb186b82b5","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"buffer must be non-null to call append.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.583682675Z"}
{"id":"e8e58f30-f1b6-4337-9633-d9a638b79ab2","expr":"!buffer.toString().isEmpty()","rationale":"Buffer string representation is not empty after appending.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.583682675Z"}
{"id":"42fa92e9-25b0-4479-90cc-8ef427867f42","expr":"buffer != null && buffer.length() >= 0","rationale":"The buffer is expected to be a valid StringBuilder with non-negative length before appending.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.583041868Z"}
{"id":"5c1dc809-b3d2-46db-b6e4-ae6e985dfe5c","expr":"buffer.length() >= fieldName.length() + 4","rationale":"After appending ' ', fieldName, and \" = \", the buffer length must be at least the length of the string appended plus the prior length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldStart(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.583997738Z"}
{"id":"89240f80-8feb-4f7c-a35b-387b4ec004e8","expr":"buffer.toString().contains(fieldName)","rationale":"The buffer contains the fieldName somewhere due to append(fieldName).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldStart(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.583997738Z"}
{"id":"3f78e56f-c77f-49e1-b5ed-a7bdb3ea8f9d","expr":"fieldName != null","rationale":"fieldName is appended directly without null checks, so it's likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldStart(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.583997738Z"}
{"id":"7832beb3-523e-40d5-afbf-8d462ff70f75","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"The buffer parameter is expected to be a valid StringBuilder instance for appending content.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldEnd(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.585052404Z"}
{"id":"532ded8c-11a5-43a8-9ac8-e3ce032f737a","expr":"fieldName != null","rationale":"Typically the fieldName parameter should not be null for formatting purposes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldEnd(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.585052404Z"}
{"id":"3ea6054e-69eb-4f3e-bcc3-fcd983db4b23","expr":"buffer.length() >= 0","rationale":"The length of the StringBuilder is always zero or positive at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldEnd(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.585052404Z"}
