{"id":"968146b0-628b-4358-ac30-22e24457ac9b","expr":"!buffer.toString().contains(fieldName) || fieldName.isEmpty()","rationale":"At method entry, the buffer may not yet contain the fieldName string, especially if this method styles the end of a field representation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldEnd(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.585052404Z"}
