{"id":"e472a2cd-9bb6-4360-9939-8dd6dd783ca8","expr":"map.size() == map.entrySet().size()","rationale":"The size of the map and the size of its entrySet are always equal.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.608382749Z"}
{"id":"7df86dc9-a4c6-4d0c-84e1-4be1ed22618c","expr":"map.isEmpty() == (map.entrySet().isEmpty())","rationale":"The map and its entrySet are either both empty or both non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:09.608382749Z"}
