{"id":"d7e19efa-9168-450c-8c22-ade11516d0a8","expr":"result == null || result.length == method.getParameterCount()","rationale":"The method returns parameter names corresponding to each parameter; thus, the length of the result array (if not null) equals the method's parameter count.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.StandardReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer#getParameterNames(Method):String @Nullable []","file":"org/springframework/core/StandardReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.054802928Z"}
{"id":"5ecb019e-3333-4b83-a558-b1465d8fc063","expr":"(result == null) || (result.length >= 0)","rationale":"If result is not null, its length must be zero or positive (being an array).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.StandardReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer#getParameterNames(Method):String @Nullable []","file":"org/springframework/core/StandardReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.054802928Z"}
{"id":"38473e83-9d82-4496-b846-25d6379258e0","expr":"parameters.length == 0 || (parameters[0] != null && parameters[0].isNamePresent())","rationale":"If parameters is not empty, the first parameter should have name present since method would otherwise return null immediately.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.StandardReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer#getParameterNames(Parameter[]):String @Nullable []","file":"org/springframework/core/StandardReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.055611751Z"}
{"id":"8e548afc-0da5-49c8-846a-31331807feba","expr":"ctor.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Constructor parameter count cannot be negative by API contract.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.StandardReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer#getParameterNames(Constructor<?>):String @Nullable []","file":"org/springframework/core/StandardReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.055728350Z"}
{"id":"f6b7a074-5ba2-4e31-928e-e965e63e8974","expr":"parameters != null","rationale":"The parameter list must not be null for method processing.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.KotlinReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer#getParameterNames(List<KParameter>):String @Nullable []","file":"org/springframework/core/KotlinReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.059466989Z"}
