{"id":"5b937bdc-66b6-4ef8-a45f-beb697fa18fa","expr":"limitLength == (limitLength ? true : false)","rationale":"limitLength is a boolean parameter, so this expression captures that limitLength is boolean.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.060903143Z"}
{"id":"61bd63d0-4578-447b-97e6-2fa5514a4eac","expr":"(limitLength ? 100 : -1) != 0","rationale":"The ternary condition yields 100 or -1, neither equal to zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.060903143Z"}
{"id":"32051690-5ed8-454b-9160-ba55bea38a92","expr":"value == null || value != null","rationale":"This expression captures that value can be null or not.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.060903143Z"}
{"id":"820c4427-a34c-489f-8501-de0e9ae696b7","expr":"!limitLength || (limitLength && (100 > 0))","rationale":"This invariant describes the numeric limit determined by limitLength.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.060903143Z"}
{"id":"ffaf9ed5-8ecc-43e1-a05c-b92110cc42be","expr":"limitLength == true || limitLength == false","rationale":"limitLength can only be true or false; this captures that fact explicitly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.060903143Z"}
{"id":"d8fbf179-f0d4-4ae6-9d75-0ee4477862de","expr":"result == null || result.length == ctor.getParameterCount()","rationale":"The returned parameter names array length corresponds to the number of parameters in the constructor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.KotlinReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer#getParameterNames(Constructor<?>):String @Nullable []","file":"org/springframework/core/KotlinReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.059187262Z"}
{"id":"52e5d401-e517-464e-8572-ddcf191a76aa","expr":"!ctor.getDeclaringClass().isEnum() || result == null","rationale":"The method explicitly returns null if the declaring class is an enum.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.KotlinReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer#getParameterNames(Constructor<?>):String @Nullable []","file":"org/springframework/core/KotlinReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.059187262Z"}
{"id":"2b372805-cb6b-491e-a1af-639bfbc728fa","expr":"result == null || result.length > 0","rationale":"If result is not null, then it must contain at least one parameter name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.KotlinReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer#getParameterNames(Constructor<?>):String @Nullable []","file":"org/springframework/core/KotlinReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.059187262Z"}
{"id":"192cb998-75d2-4dae-b34c-a875c48fc654","expr":"parameters.length >= 0","rationale":"Java array length is non-negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.StandardReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer#getParameterNames(Parameter[]):String @Nullable []","file":"org/springframework/core/StandardReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.055611751Z"}
{"id":"4dc8ea90-2fb8-4233-bc33-a40894eb0c05","expr":"result == null || method.getParameters().length == result.length","rationale":"The returned array length must match the length of the parameters array obtained from method.getParameters().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.StandardReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer#getParameterNames(Method):String @Nullable []","file":"org/springframework/core/StandardReflectionParameterNameDiscoverer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.054802928Z"}
{"id":"83acd25e-5479-46a4-b8d2-c253ebe6662f","expr":"logger != null && messageFactory != null && !logger.isDebugEnabled() || messageFactory.apply(logger.isTraceEnabled()) != null","rationale":"If debug is enabled, then messageFactory.apply with traceEnabled boolean argument likely returns a valid non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#traceDebug(Log,Function<Boolean, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.062881527Z"}
{"id":"bb4fa552-57c3-4b1f-acd6-e7be43e546c1","expr":"!logger.isTraceEnabled() || logger.isDebugEnabled()","rationale":"Logger's traceEnabled implies debugEnabled, i.e., trace is a finer-grained log level than debug.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#traceDebug(Log,Function<Boolean, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.062881527Z"}
{"id":"40f01202-4213-416f-96a5-99b0ba08ca57","expr":"messageFactory.apply(true) != null || messageFactory.apply(false) != null","rationale":"At least one application of messageFactory before execution is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#traceDebug(Log,Function<Boolean, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.062881527Z"}
{"id":"476e4409-6414-4376-9623-9e5ccd624369","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() || !logger.isTraceEnabled()","rationale":"Trace enabled implies debug enabled; expressed as logger.isDebugEnabled() || !logger.isTraceEnabled()","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#traceDebug(Log,Function<Boolean, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.062881527Z"}
{"id":"fa84d4d5-f1d6-4976-8f6f-60e0337b28ee","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() == false || messageFactory.apply(logger.isTraceEnabled()) != null","rationale":"When debug is enabled, the messageFactory is applied; its result logMessage must not be null for logging calls.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#traceDebug(Log,Function<Boolean, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.063574252Z"}
{"id":"8a80ced7-5bf0-4ba5-8ee3-96245eef4f35","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || (logger.isTraceEnabled() || !logger.isTraceEnabled())","rationale":"traceEnabled is assigned from logger.isTraceEnabled(), so it's either true or false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#traceDebug(Log,Function<Boolean, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.063574252Z"}
{"id":"e35a3273-8cfc-455e-ae18-b97a5f0a1530","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || (logger.isTraceEnabled() && logger.isDebugEnabled()) == logger.isTraceEnabled()","rationale":"If debug is enabled, then traceEnabled state remains consistent with logger.isTraceEnabled()","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#traceDebug(Log,Function<Boolean, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.063574252Z"}
{"id":"5cb04881-3d5b-4fcb-a8e6-c2ea5b41dce6","expr":"maxLength >= -1","rationale":"maxLength is compared to -1, so it must be greater than or equal to -1","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,int,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.064396550Z"}
{"id":"72eb288d-0fba-4282-8ea3-43e5cd1ad489","expr":"value == null || maxLength != -1 || maxLength >= 0","rationale":"maxLength, when not equal to -1, is expected to be >= 0","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,int,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.064396550Z"}
{"id":"6db123cd-6f03-4fe5-98e3-9794cba38068","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method constructs and returns a new CompositeLog object unconditionally.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getCompositeLog(Log,Log,Log):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.063580664Z"}
{"id":"d2cf373e-b398-42ac-9c9b-c62f65ceb05f","expr":"result.toString().contains(primaryLogger.toString()) || primaryLogger == null","rationale":"Given the behavior of CompositeLog including all provided loggers, result reflects presence of primaryLogger.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getCompositeLog(Log,Log,Log):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.063580664Z"}
{"id":"2a69ec11-76cd-4020-855b-fe3499eb588c","expr":"result.toString().contains(secondaryLogger.toString()) || secondaryLogger == null","rationale":"CompositeLog includes all passed loggers, so result's representation includes secondaryLogger if it exists.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getCompositeLog(Log,Log,Log):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.063580664Z"}
{"id":"bdd15f05-e4ae-4403-b798-38d7890e3973","expr":"primaryLogger != null || secondaryLogger != null || tertiaryLoggers.length > 0","rationale":"CompositeLog will contain at least one logger, so at least one input must be non-null or an additional tertiary logger provided.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getCompositeLog(Log,Log,Log):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.065265406Z"}
{"id":"182ee1c7-885a-4a40-98cd-8ac0191aeab2","expr":"clazz != null && clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"The method calls clazz.getName(), so clazz and its name should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getHiddenLog(Class<?>):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.063686944Z"}
{"id":"a3f8652e-7721-4fdc-8e46-61c9dfe828e4","expr":"tertiaryLoggers.length >= 0","rationale":"Tertiary loggers argument is an array; its length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getCompositeLog(Log,Log,Log):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.065265406Z"}
{"id":"af752448-e1b2-473a-a117-94578593b518","expr":"replaceNewlinesAndControlCharacters == true || replaceNewlinesAndControlCharacters == false","rationale":"replaceNewlinesAndControlCharacters is a boolean parameter","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,int,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.064396550Z"}
{"id":"765f8a64-957c-44e1-bda0-d036a6780493","expr":"!(value == null && maxLength < -1)","rationale":"If value is null then maxLength cannot be less than -1","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,int,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.064396550Z"}
{"id":"33b29c55-fcaa-40f5-af10-c1a96f50379b","expr":"category != null && category.length() > 0","rationale":"The method uses category in string concatenation, so category is non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getHiddenLog(String):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.065344705Z"}
{"id":"db25dd55-a834-411d-9f21-351f8c8d74a7","expr":"category != null","rationale":"category must be non-null for the string concatenation in the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getHiddenLog(String):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.065344705Z"}
{"id":"60a482dd-53a9-4043-9f89-fa54376f6cb5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"result is always assigned some string value before return, never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,int,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.064822933Z"}
{"id":"a59a1218-ffdf-4da2-adb7-d622781e3db7","expr":"clazz != null && result != null && result.getName().equals(clazz.getName())","rationale":"Since result comes from getHiddenLog(clazz.getName()), its name should match clazz.getName() and neither should be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getHiddenLog(Class<?>):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.064734486Z"}
{"id":"a1be6dfd-cb6f-4ae5-ba53-1efd74533089","expr":"(maxLength == -1 || result.length() <= maxLength + 2)","rationale":"If maxLength is set, result is truncated to that length, and possibly quotes are added (max 2 extra chars).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,int,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.064822933Z"}
{"id":"05bef643-eb4f-4d48-b479-5f17ad4a4ae2","expr":"result != null","rationale":"LogFactory.getLog(String) is expected to always return a non-null Log.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getHiddenLog(String):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.066331493Z"}
{"id":"826e828e-2b95-46a5-9a4e-7bebbc0ec630","expr":"result.toString().contains(category)","rationale":"Since the Log name includes the category, its string representation includes the category substring.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getHiddenLog(String):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.066331493Z"}
{"id":"2e84c05d-130a-4729-b0c9-76a98c4880d0","expr":"! (primaryLogger == secondaryLogger && secondaryLogger == null)","rationale":"At least one logger among primary, secondary or tertiary is present to avoid empty CompositeLog.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getCompositeLog(Log,Log,Log):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.065265406Z"}
{"id":"b608081f-cb92-455a-9f9d-871d54acf3c4","expr":"(value == null) || (result != null)","rationale":"If value is null, result may be null; if value is not null, result must be a non-null String representation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.065622809Z"}
{"id":"4b683282-c916-4f0a-b23e-495c4b2507ed","expr":"result.length() <= 100 || !limitLength","rationale":"The method limits the length of the output string to 100 characters when limitLength is true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.065622809Z"}
{"id":"09f277c0-3ec5-49b9-b391-6d21bbf5153f","expr":"clazz.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Class names typically are non-empty strings, so the length of clazz.getName() should be positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getHiddenLog(Class<?>):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.063686944Z"}
{"id":"1913e6f3-f41a-468e-baeb-d57f6b97b7fa","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a String, so result must not be null on method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.065622809Z"}
{"id":"c086e851-368e-4a3c-bb63-7735a367aa08","expr":"primaryLogger != secondaryLogger || tertiaryLoggers.length > 0","rationale":"There is no need to combine loggers if primary and secondary are identical and there are no tertiary loggers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getCompositeLog(Log,Log,Log):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.065265406Z"}
{"id":"060149a4-fc03-4b4c-89e6-cc20f0191edc","expr":"(! (value == null) || result.equals(\"\"))","rationale":"If value is null, result is the empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,int,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.064822933Z"}
{"id":"253b586c-3554-4a27-9677-ea184e12f4fb","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The result of getHiddenLog should not be null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getHiddenLog(Class<?>):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.064734486Z"}
{"id":"0e6aeee9-2443-4bb3-976e-12be7a807923","expr":"primaryLogger == null || !primaryLogger.equals(secondaryLogger)","rationale":"It is likely primary and secondary loggers are deliberately different for composition when primaryLogger is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getCompositeLog(Log,Log,Log):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.065265406Z"}
{"id":"52b12331-50d2-4baa-89d6-8d6767d7adbb","expr":"!limitLength || result.length() <= 100","rationale":"If limitLength is true, result length is at most 100 characters due to formatValue call with limit 100.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.065622809Z"}
{"id":"9ab96884-8324-487a-81a6-d5dc6a09fbd1","expr":"(value == null) || result.length() >= 0","rationale":"If value is not null, result must be a non-null String with non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.065622809Z"}
{"id":"645f5fe0-1e64-43d6-8af5-1919e8bb9fca","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"The method is about getting a Log for a class, usually not for primitive types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getHiddenLog(Class<?>):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.063686944Z"}
{"id":"69835940-4147-4480-8a70-f38a7d4b6619","expr":"clazz.isArray() == false","rationale":"Getting log for array classes might be unsupported or unnecessary.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getHiddenLog(Class<?>):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.063686944Z"}
{"id":"7436dd2a-9f4d-41bd-aaae-132504af4096","expr":"clazz.getName().equals(clazz.getName())","rationale":"Method calls rely on class name, so this identity holds trivially but confirms consistency.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogDelegateFactory#getHiddenLog(Class<?>):Log","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogDelegateFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.063686944Z"}
{"id":"6c27446b-7741-4163-9903-4cb369862027","expr":"result == (true || false)","rationale":"Result is a boolean value.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogAccessor#isWarnEnabled():boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogAccessor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.074577568Z"}
{"id":"b364ee2e-7ac5-4ed3-9e70-2c5af28861bc","expr":"result == (result == true || result == false)","rationale":"Ensures result is a valid boolean value.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogAccessor#isTraceEnabled():boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogAccessor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:10.078659904Z"}
