{"id":"b34e8e8e-2413-4924-bcaf-759908f73ff4","expr":"properties != null","rationale":"The argument to setProperties is expected to be a non-null Properties object for setting local properties.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:11.911913657Z"}
