{"id":"78dd76b6-8171-4657-b6d8-248fcd2c59df","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always initializes and returns a Properties object, so result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String,ClassLoader):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:11.932423872Z"}
{"id":"8297b6b5-d087-4360-80a9-bbdf8806ad1f","expr":"resourceName != null || result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If the input resourceName is null, the Properties object result is likely empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:11.931992380Z"}
