{"id":"3bea89b8-a986-4536-b0a1-621267351ee6","expr":"type != null && type.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"The method expects a non-null class type that is not primitive because Java serialization typically applies to object types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.ReflectionHints#registerJavaSerialization(Class<?>):ReflectionHints","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/ReflectionHints.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.463715226Z"}
