{"id":"ebdc2664-c935-4c5a-bed7-6c071b582746","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns a SimpleTypeReference created from a valid class name, the result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#of(String):SimpleTypeReference","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.523966956Z"}
{"id":"cb67500d-fc12-4b2a-8fdd-50a60e030fec","expr":"result.getClassName().equals(className) || className.contains(\"$\")","rationale":"From method logic, if className has no '$', result's className equals className; otherwise, result represents nested types.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#of(String):SimpleTypeReference","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.523966956Z"}
