{"id":"d96b3a5e-e83b-4787-8e3c-da57f40b3d22","expr":"!className.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Valid Java class names do not contain whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#isValidClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.524405992Z"}
{"id":"64840432-3b57-4c37-aa62-2a16ca3919a9","expr":"result == (className != null && !className.contains(\" \"))","rationale":"A class name with spaces is not valid, so result being true implies no spaces in className.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#isValidClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.524595659Z"}
{"id":"49c39777-f141-4fc6-85a6-6c598317ad6f","expr":"!result || className != null","rationale":"The method cannot return true for null input, so if result is true, className is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#isValidClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.524595659Z"}
{"id":"4ddae147-306f-492c-847b-fa0f91a01714","expr":"className.split(\"\\\\.\", -1).length > 0","rationale":"The split of className by '.' always yields at least one segment.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#isValidClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.524405992Z"}
{"id":"a44142a8-9ff1-4046-b0d3-ab7ba91904e6","expr":"!className.startsWith(\".\") && !className.endsWith(\".\")","rationale":"A valid className is unlikely to start or end with a '.' character to form valid identifiers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#isValidClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.524405992Z"}
{"id":"31f23622-8227-4cd4-b809-a8345df2129f","expr":"className != null && className.length() > 0","rationale":"className is expected to be a valid non-empty string so that lastIndexOf('.') and substring operations are well-defined.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#createTypeReference(String):SimpleTypeReference","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.524690318Z"}
{"id":"111a61a0-fe9e-4784-8095-4ac6ce37f1a9","expr":"className.indexOf('.') >= -1","rationale":"className.indexOf('.') is always >= -1 by definition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#createTypeReference(String):SimpleTypeReference","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.524690318Z"}
{"id":"92aa3238-5085-4eaa-a385-db1035459639","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a new SimpleTypeReference, so result must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#createTypeReference(String):SimpleTypeReference","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.525024517Z"}
{"id":"8c202854-461d-473e-8030-8162fcd22f36","expr":"result == (className != null && !className.isEmpty())","rationale":"Since splitting empty string produces an array with one empty string which is not a valid identifier, result is false if className is empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#isValidClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.524595659Z"}
{"id":"4b942aa0-3c5f-42ab-b6b4-6cf4398d890e","expr":"result.getName().equals(className.substring(className.lastIndexOf('.') + 1)) || result.getName().equals(className)","rationale":"The name in result corresponds to the substring after the last dot in className, or className itself if no dot.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#createTypeReference(String):SimpleTypeReference","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.525024517Z"}
{"id":"689a0be6-3e17-4c9e-8790-fb7efd7439ee","expr":"result.getEnclosingType() == null","rationale":"The enclosing type of the result is always null as passed to the constructor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#createTypeReference(String):SimpleTypeReference","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.525024517Z"}
{"id":"46aff025-e54a-45f3-b956-51d56d6c33c8","expr":"className.lastIndexOf('.') <= className.length() - 1","rationale":"The lastIndexOf('.') is either -1 or a valid index within the string length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#createTypeReference(String):SimpleTypeReference","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.524690318Z"}
{"id":"ee6cdd1a-19a6-480f-a1c8-908edf39e9da","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns canonicalName which is initialized if null, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#getCanonicalName():String","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.526082699Z"}
{"id":"f0b22f16-ee1a-44e6-a05d-ae227a8f5a79","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"The canonical name should be a valid non-empty string representation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#getCanonicalName():String","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.526082699Z"}
{"id":"2fcbcfd5-9574-44b5-864e-cbca5fc96a87","expr":"result.indexOf(' ') == -1","rationale":"Canonical names usually are package-qualified class names without spaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#getCanonicalName():String","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.526082699Z"}
{"id":"1ac154cf-02f3-41e5-8824-2de843956af9","expr":"result.equals(result.trim())","rationale":"The canonical name is normalized without extra whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#getCanonicalName():String","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.526082699Z"}
{"id":"c024dc9d-0f63-49b6-856d-913667040636","expr":"result == true || result == false","rationale":"The return value is a boolean primitive, so it can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#isPrimitive():boolean","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.527147784Z"}
{"id":"997225c0-1fbc-4631-a1d7-b25e35b30004","expr":"(!className.contains(\".\") || className.lastIndexOf('.') == className.indexOf('.'))","rationale":"className contains zero or one '.' character at entry point.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#createTypeReference(String):SimpleTypeReference","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.524690318Z"}
{"id":"60acc0c7-d693-4c27-b274-369f5b664e9b","expr":"className.trim().length() == className.length()","rationale":"Likely invariant to avoid errors in processing names; leading/trailing spaces unlikely","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#createTypeReference(String):SimpleTypeReference","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.524690318Z"}
{"id":"8cbab480-67d8-4f58-bec6-bce722ea344f","expr":"result.contains(\".\") || !result.contains(\"$\")","rationale":"Canonical names usually include dots as package separators and may or may not contain inner class separators ('$').","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#getCanonicalName():String","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.526082699Z"}
{"id":"ae9bb48c-8d93-4433-aba2-62e8bb4af816","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0","rationale":"name is expected to be non-null and non-empty since it is used in name::startsWith","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#isPrimitive(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.527893037Z"}
{"id":"93d0483c-155e-459d-849f-2b349ddf5b58","expr":"!result || name.length() > 0","rationale":"If result is true, name length must be positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#isPrimitive(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.528025326Z"}
{"id":"62d35cf5-0b78-46c8-8819-f81e97ae1cfa","expr":"(type == null) || (sb != null)","rationale":"If 'type' is null, method returns immediately, so sb can be anything; otherwise, sb should be non-null for insert call.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#buildName(TypeReference,StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.528381898Z"}
{"id":"4c0239d7-c87d-46b1-aafc-cdfe895eaba7","expr":"(type == null) || (type.getSimpleName() != null)","rationale":"If 'type' is not null, its getSimpleName() should return non-null string as it is used to build the name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#buildName(TypeReference,StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.528381898Z"}
{"id":"307c4885-c799-4b93-83f5-641df9c9a35c","expr":"sb.length() > 0","rationale":"At method exit, sb has been populated with type names, so its length must be greater than zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#buildName(TypeReference,StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.528541879Z"}
{"id":"6e8e4f4f-7549-43b8-bd93-4e4b50a2ac21","expr":"type == null || sb.toString().endsWith(type.getSimpleName())","rationale":"If type is not null, sb ends with the simple name of the given type, as it is inserted first then enclosing types are prepended.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#buildName(TypeReference,StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.528541879Z"}
{"id":"95b8520a-3354-435c-82d4-f57a860aa34b","expr":"(type == null) || (sb.length() >= 0)","rationale":"If type is not null, sb is non-null and StringBuilder length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#buildName(TypeReference,StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.528381898Z"}
