{"id":"8f92d6f4-97c5-4cd8-a2d8-461d4127821f","expr":"names != null && indexes != null && names.length == indexes.length","rationale":"Since the method uses both arrays together for index lookup, their lengths are likely equal to ensure corresponding elements.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.FieldProviderTransformer#getByIndex(String[],int[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/FieldProviderTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.992486812Z"}
