{"id":"f0e0378d-be2a-4f08-8a67-25a1dc80e08c","expr":"names != null && names.length > 0","rationale":"The method uses the 'names' array to set fields, so it must be non-null and contain at least one element for the method to complete successfully.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.FieldProviderTransformer#setField(String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/FieldProviderTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:14.997164950Z"}
