{"id":"91240523-cdde-4c06-963c-5f9607354e5c","expr":"value == null || type.getClass().isInstance(value)","rationale":"If a value is provided for the field, it should be compatible with the declared field type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#declare_field(int,String,Type,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.004666744Z"}
{"id":"bba3e6d3-4157-4516-acb1-63a4c3a4c080","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Ensuring 'name' is a valid string representing a method or field name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.007491803Z"}
{"id":"2046bc92-92b1-4534-bb0f-2516754a520b","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The 'type' input parameter is expected to be non-null because the method manipulates or uses it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.007491803Z"}
{"id":"fb0895aa-0b1d-47a3-bfa0-48ec562d9377","expr":"type.getDescriptor() != null && !type.getDescriptor().isEmpty()","rationale":"The descriptor from 'type' is used to create method signatures and must be valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.007491803Z"}
{"id":"53c0ca47-fcd8-4ae1-adea-55a4c8d63b2a","expr":"!name.contains(\" \")","rationale":"The method 'name' should not contain spaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.007491803Z"}
{"id":"34abfbc0-7e02-4b64-b255-106207dd9c10","expr":"!type.isPrimitive() || type.getDescriptor().length() == 1","rationale":"Primitive types generally have single-character descriptors.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.007491803Z"}
{"id":"18afdb79-73e1-4687-ac38-d3560cfdc9c2","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Having a valid 'name' is necessary because it is used to generate the method signature and to access fields.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.008306427Z"}
{"id":"994a981d-d48e-4d5b-a97f-4a44d5b15cf3","expr":"type != null","rationale":"'type' is essential as the method requires its descriptor string and type information.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.008306427Z"}
{"id":"6f4bee5d-63c7-4b70-bfd6-74922f2e0e04","expr":"type.getDescriptor() != null","rationale":"The getDescriptor() method of 'type' returns a non-null descriptor necessary to form the method signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.008306427Z"}
{"id":"2c7eb291-0618-4a3b-a014-619f027a19d1","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Ensures the 'name' parameter is not empty to prevent invalid field or method signatures.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.008306427Z"}
{"id":"99c2307e-3c55-4f30-8d7b-a8a676eadfdc","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Since the method uses name to define a write method signature and get a field, it must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.008734743Z"}
{"id":"bfd58ee7-7ce1-4278-b59f-37e87ab26e31","expr":"type != null","rationale":"Type is used several times in method calls; it cannot be null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.008734743Z"}
{"id":"db6f8e10-15a4-48b7-a81a-a12833dc0660","expr":"type.getDescriptor() != null && !type.getDescriptor().isEmpty()","rationale":"The type descriptor string must be non-null and non-empty as it is used to build the method signature.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.008734743Z"}
{"id":"83817e98-0ca0-412d-8fe6-d1d20f78513b","expr":"name.equals(name)","rationale":"Avoided since trivial.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.008734743Z"}
{"id":"69db3576-fd72-4adc-aa14-482aa26820c7","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Reinforces the non-empty string property of name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.008734743Z"}
{"id":"437707a8-9e34-49b4-9ae3-7078fe56483f","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method likely expects a valid field name as a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.010406320Z"}
{"id":"08b4bfef-c135-4d4c-a8fd-da4a56fcc2a4","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method requires a type object to proceed with generating the read method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.010406320Z"}
{"id":"0602adcb-1995-4934-b9ec-03579debb0c1","expr":"type.getDescriptor() != null && !type.getDescriptor().isEmpty()","rationale":"The type descriptor string should be valid for constructing read method signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.010406320Z"}
{"id":"34a1a6c5-9c43-45ca-aca1-f6018fd17f15","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since begin_method returns a new CodeEmitter object wrapping super.begin_method, result is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.011788122Z"}
{"id":"340f1701-2f2d-4a2b-bdb3-e2e4e3b290e5","expr":"name != null && desc != null","rationale":"Concatenation with name and desc implies both are not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.016779479Z"}
{"id":"56d3dd9c-33ed-47cf-ba1f-102fb20d52fa","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"The method reads a method signature using a non-empty name for uniqueness.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.016779479Z"}
{"id":"24dc9506-b42c-4213-b50b-10d97d127215","expr":"desc.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"The method descriptor string usually starts with '(' for argument list in JVM signatures.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.016779479Z"}
