{"id":"6251fd24-d9b9-4ad9-9172-ef6825e56613","expr":"(access & 0x0200) == 0 || interfaces.length > 0","rationale":"If the class is not an interface, interfaces might be modified to include ENABLED.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.004397648Z"}
{"id":"ff35dea0-f91b-415a-a3f8-462a9af5c5af","expr":"superType != null","rationale":"A class must have a supertype defined unless it is java.lang.Object or an interface.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.004397648Z"}
{"id":"d6a87630-328e-4013-be30-63ca414c3410","expr":"sourceFile == null || !sourceFile.isEmpty()","rationale":"Source file may be null or a valid string if specified.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.004397648Z"}
{"id":"b168bc79-8237-4ec2-a4a2-d430b83218e3","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method appends name to a string to create a signature; if name were empty, the signature would be less meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.017581459Z"}
{"id":"581bfe65-af9a-406b-950f-f0c333360ce9","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is concatenated into the signature string, so it must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.017581459Z"}
{"id":"4138476b-e5fe-4c53-a1e1-c5455b834a85","expr":"desc.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"Typically method descriptor strings start with '(' to indicate parameter list start.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.017581459Z"}
{"id":"751b259e-3230-4864-96f0-0dd656214d63","expr":"!name.contains(\"$\")","rationale":"The original name likely does not contain '$' to avoid collisions since '$cglib_write_' is used to distinguish the generated signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.017581459Z"}
{"id":"586d502e-c777-4077-9827-1a4f1cb00fad","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method constructs and returns a new Signature object, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.018006269Z"}
