{"id":"a345ad12-c123-4d2a-8f7b-6bde4e22de47","expr":"superType != null","rationale":"At the start of this method, the superType parameter should be a valid Type indicating the superclass.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.024378597Z"}
{"id":"4073d51a-541a-4c55-8712-e8a7c538b504","expr":"interfaces != null","rationale":"The interfaces parameter represents the interfaces the class implements and should be non-null even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.024378597Z"}
{"id":"da8c8143-f327-4fbe-a70f-084e835fb285","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"The version number used in bytecode generation should be a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.024378597Z"}
{"id":"e92dc471-e0e3-4ace-818d-e855c84d4d42","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null String.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#callbackName(Type):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.025411471Z"}
