{"id":"687c4188-dbfd-42d6-88f0-56c782bc5502","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"This invariant captures that access modifiers are non-negative integer values.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AccessFieldTransformer#declare_field(int,String,Type,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AccessFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.028727575Z"}
