{"id":"6ef31437-5a76-4b3d-8d36-3402b1f3273e","expr":"!Double.isNaN(result) || Double.isNaN(oldValue)","rationale":"If oldValue is NaN, result is NaN; otherwise result is not NaN. Both share the same NaN state since result equals oldValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readDouble(Object,String,double):double","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.045575305Z"}
