{"id":"6f0d7d0d-cbd1-407a-be26-e153b0184ce4","expr":"v != null","rationale":"At method entry, the ClassVisitor parameter v is non-null to allow further calls.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassReaderGenerator#generateClass(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassReaderGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.048852385Z"}
