{"id":"4691cdc3-641a-4165-bc20-153af27119a7","expr":"av1 == null || av2 == null || !av1.equals(av2)","rationale":"When both av1 and av2 are non-null, the returned AnnotationVisitorTee combines two distinct visitors, so av1 and av2 are not equal.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AnnotationVisitorTee#getInstance(AnnotationVisitor,AnnotationVisitor):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AnnotationVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.050716725Z"}
