{"id":"18bf5255-3b53-4cc6-ba28-8a154f593bef","expr":"name == null || !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"If name is not null, it is likely not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AnnotationVisitorTee#visitArray(String):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AnnotationVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.053435273Z"}
{"id":"abe7bbcf-600b-45e0-8bd4-6c12dd6a1302","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a new AnnotationVisitor instance, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AnnotationVisitorTee#visitArray(String):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AnnotationVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.053910949Z"}
