{"id":"69f16b56-1160-45d9-904e-d87bf4b8697b","expr":"name.indexOf(' ') < 0","rationale":"Class names are expected to be valid fully qualified names without spaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#loadClass(String):Class","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.055761483Z"}
{"id":"95216a62-5a92-4770-a64a-f1472b122d30","expr":"name.contains(\".\")","rationale":"It is typical for class names passed to ClassLoader to include package names separated by dots.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#loadClass(String):Class","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.055761483Z"}
{"id":"5cd2c9fa-f6d7-4859-8371-7cfdeb8578e1","expr":"name.equals(name.trim())","rationale":"The parameter 'name' is expected to have no leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#loadClass(String):Class","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.055761483Z"}
{"id":"bd7109aa-998e-4007-aed5-9de4eec44c41","expr":"name != null && desc != null","rationale":"Both 'name' and 'desc' are likely non-null as they are passed to other visitAnnotation methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AnnotationVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,String):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AnnotationVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.052247447Z"}
{"id":"7deb7a74-5dad-4f36-b459-337a10dd729d","expr":"name.length() > 0 || desc.length() > 0","rationale":"Either 'name' or 'desc' should have content; empty annotations unlikely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AnnotationVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,String):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AnnotationVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.052247447Z"}
{"id":"2dfe3005-1ee6-4aca-8061-4e5477ebd0f4","expr":"name.equals(name) == true","rationale":"Ensuring 'name' can be compared by equals without exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AnnotationVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,String):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AnnotationVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.052247447Z"}
{"id":"6a1ae120-738e-4892-a75e-6149d09e6299","expr":"!name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'name' parameter most likely represents a meaningful identifier and thus is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AnnotationVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,String):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AnnotationVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.052247447Z"}
{"id":"fce07423-61b8-4561-99a6-211008a5c72f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method is designed to load a class by name and return a Class object. If the method returns normally rather than throwing an exception, the result should be a valid Class instance corresponding to the requested name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#loadClass(String):Class","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.056139284Z"}
{"id":"40bcffca-a503-4357-88cd-d98fd63d3997","expr":"result.getName().equals(name)","rationale":"Since the method loads a class by the given name and returns it, the class's getName() method should return the same name string used as the input parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#loadClass(String):Class","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.056139284Z"}
{"id":"60bb845e-554d-459e-b7fa-d7bd5195c41b","expr":"name != null && desc != null && value != null && !name.isEmpty() && !desc.isEmpty() && !value.isEmpty()","rationale":"Since the method forwards parameters to visitEnum, it's likely name, desc, and value are non-null and non-empty strings representing enum information.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AnnotationVisitorTee#visitEnum(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AnnotationVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.052544476Z"}
{"id":"6778764a-fc9e-4332-a77b-79ad72f59d72","expr":"value.equals(value.trim())","rationale":"Enum values are generally expected to be trimmed strings without surrounding whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AnnotationVisitorTee#visitEnum(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AnnotationVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.052544476Z"}
{"id":"0f1b0f45-d32f-4ce3-b741-a320f89a523b","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Enum name should be a valid identifier, thus non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AnnotationVisitorTee#visitEnum(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AnnotationVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.052544476Z"}
{"id":"f986cab1-c919-4bf7-8ca0-4aee66195859","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a new ClassReaderGenerator instance, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#getGenerator(ClassReader):ClassGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.056491277Z"}
{"id":"b51b3e77-57e7-4958-840d-5fe9de8268b8","expr":"result.reader == r","rationale":"Assuming ClassReaderGenerator stores the passed ClassReader in a field named 'reader', result.reader should be same as r.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#getGenerator(ClassReader):ClassGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.056491277Z"}
{"id":"827fd3a1-4b93-40d1-8726-3ecdeb5ec28e","expr":"r != null","rationale":"The method is likely designed to be called with a non-null ClassReader instance.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#getGenerator(ClassReader):ClassGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.056489433Z"}
{"id":"1b1b719e-b077-46d0-b042-a063abcfaae7","expr":"r.getClassName() != null","rationale":"getClassName() typically returns the internal class name, likely non-null if r is a valid ClassReader.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#getGenerator(ClassReader):ClassGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.056489433Z"}
{"id":"d5d94dc8-e313-4348-8c60-19885ece2038","expr":"r.getSuperName() != null || r.getSuperName() == null","rationale":"The method getSuperName may return null or non-null depending on class; included for completeness.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#getGenerator(ClassReader):ClassGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.056489433Z"}
{"id":"a6ed366a-15ee-4bc3-bef4-c2cb55ee5392","expr":"r.getAccess() >= 0","rationale":"Access flags are typically non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#getGenerator(ClassReader):ClassGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.056489433Z"}
{"id":"aa23d165-2750-4af7-b1ad-9723a3e883a9","expr":"r.getInterfaces() != null","rationale":"getInterfaces() returns a non-null array reference.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#getGenerator(ClassReader):ClassGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.056489433Z"}
