{"id":"4a465cdd-7ad9-4311-b57b-c127e204d90b","expr":"c != null","rationale":"The method parameter c should not be null when postProcess is called.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#postProcess(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.059087304Z"}
{"id":"5ed09645-a7ca-4bd1-ac7b-c04d725eb6a4","expr":"c.getModifiers() >= 0","rationale":"Class modifiers are non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#postProcess(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.059087304Z"}
{"id":"b71b4040-7857-4380-8683-390cad994f06","expr":"!c.isPrimitive() || c.isArray() || true","rationale":"Represents that c is a Class and primitive checks are valid here.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#postProcess(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.059087304Z"}
{"id":"14be0217-b04d-450e-8a59-70f73de54919","expr":"c != null","rationale":"Parameter c is likely to be non-null after method execution since no modification or assignment to c is shown.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassLoader#postProcess(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.059574011Z"}
{"id":"e8ccd847-a397-40ff-a23b-9b1508103c5a","expr":"!name.contains(\" \") && !desc.contains(\" \") && !value.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Spaces are generally not present in enum names, descriptors, or values.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AnnotationVisitorTee#visitEnum(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AnnotationVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.052544476Z"}
