{"id":"abccc6b7-5d9f-4455-880f-b8962567fb5b","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method name parameter should be a valid method name which is not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.064230127Z"}
{"id":"7201ddee-7b01-43bb-8527-1adc8a34537d","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method descriptor string describes the method signature and must be valid and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.064230127Z"}
{"id":"12508cab-6976-46cb-9d5c-8ff6d3c30076","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() >= 0","rationale":"Signature is optional type info or null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.063835294Z"}
{"id":"1768da3f-a912-4454-a357-43dbf73793f6","expr":"exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"The exceptions array passed can be null or contain zero or more elements.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.064230127Z"}
{"id":"f7849351-3c9b-4869-adee-247ce7960fcd","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() >= 0","rationale":"The signature string parameter can be null or any string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.064230127Z"}
{"id":"b6d1d9d2-74a7-4ad8-9ae3-963d9fd2e5ac","expr":"(access & 0xFFFFF000) == 0","rationale":"Access modifiers are expected to be encoded in the lower bits without exceeding typical modifier flags.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.064230127Z"}
{"id":"57853638-5f81-405c-8b1d-cd44d6b8ddfd","expr":"source != null || debug != null","rationale":"source and debug can both be independently null or non-null, but method can be called with at least one non-null to provide meaningful data.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.064975330Z"}
{"id":"ae7418f6-9e66-4087-bd99-c02085a649c4","expr":"(source != null) == (source != null)","rationale":"Discarding trivial tautology invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.064975330Z"}
{"id":"23037a45-723d-434e-83e6-13d9d25498a8","expr":"(debug == null) || (debug.length() >= 0)","rationale":"debug is either null or has length 0 or more, expresses valid debug string length when not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.064975330Z"}
{"id":"8e50a872-8b83-4f10-b563-304c91ec9067","expr":"(source == null) || source.isEmpty() || source.length() > 0","rationale":"source is a String that may be empty or non-empty when not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.064975330Z"}
{"id":"0bc2586f-edf6-480d-ae6e-d463088e9f5a","expr":"source != null || debug != null","rationale":"The method forwards both source and debug parameters to two different visitors, so at least one may be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.065172712Z"}
{"id":"9a8731bc-90ef-4b0f-b1bf-ee39eba4a436","expr":"source == null || source.length() > 0","rationale":"Typically source strings represent file names or identifiers and thus would not be empty if present.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.065172712Z"}
{"id":"88ea8895-e53d-4de8-acd3-9d76eafcbc8b","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() > 0","rationale":"Debug information if present is expected to be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.065172712Z"}
{"id":"30788a73-d9e2-40c5-82ad-5b0f716d39f1","expr":"(source == null) == (debug == null) || !source.equals(debug)","rationale":"No assumption they should be equal, but if both nullness matches, then generally not equal strings.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.065172712Z"}
{"id":"70777eb1-5616-445c-881c-b0ac0bc2d32c","expr":"source != null || debug == null","rationale":"Reflects possible null states but no strict dependency.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.065172712Z"}
{"id":"9efdb411-796d-4d4e-858a-700267800790","expr":"(source != null && debug != null) || (source == null || debug == null)","rationale":"This covers trivial null state combinations but is essentially trivial.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.064975330Z"}
{"id":"c096e686-817c-4005-9641-ba897f2023b4","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'owner' parameter should be a non-null, non-empty string representing the internal class name of the outer class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.066358394Z"}
{"id":"022656f3-c9da-4322-8765-ae297051f746","expr":"(name == null) || (name != null && !name.isEmpty())","rationale":"The 'name' parameter can be null or non-empty string representing the outer method's name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.066358394Z"}
{"id":"1d926809-0473-4b25-953d-52fb9aed0031","expr":"(desc == null) || (desc != null && !desc.isEmpty())","rationale":"The 'desc' parameter can be null or a non-empty method descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.066358394Z"}
{"id":"73e53be3-c2f6-4c2f-8cef-6caf3b2770d6","expr":"(name == null) == (desc == null)","rationale":"'name' and 'desc' parameters are both null or both non-null, representing the outer method signature presence or absence.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.066358394Z"}
{"id":"0c83fb9d-7b96-4d49-8955-f6c88ce8f2dd","expr":"!owner.equals(name)","rationale":"The 'owner' and 'name' are different strings as one is a class name and other a method name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.066358394Z"}
{"id":"79aa1fa1-a2cb-4f58-9aa0-4cc49071fede","expr":"(owner != null) || (name == null && desc == null)","rationale":"The method consistently forwards the parameters; if owner is null, name and desc are probably null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.066655083Z"}
{"id":"59f38551-6c52-47c9-af5c-32c657a37339","expr":"(name == null) || (owner != null)","rationale":"If name is not null, owner should not be null due to method call semantics.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.066655083Z"}
{"id":"47fbc7c7-a1fd-441a-9bcf-b4e31f111571","expr":"(desc == null) || (owner != null)","rationale":"If desc is not null, owner is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.066655083Z"}
{"id":"7195dacc-512e-4486-9a35-7f2f4d6015cd","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns the result of AnnotationVisitorTee.getInstance, which is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.068921059Z"}
{"id":"16fd208e-cb82-45a4-82dc-05e61586b561","expr":"attrs != null","rationale":"The method forwards the attrs parameter to other visitors, so attrs is expected to be non-null to ensure valid visit calls.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.067883456Z"}
{"id":"f750f826-f5ac-478d-b745-a7eeab4b7f87","expr":"attrs != null && attrs.toString() != null","rationale":"Attribute's toString should return a non-null string representation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.067883456Z"}
{"id":"b8c79da0-4ad7-47b5-ae3a-b2f25a7e333d","expr":"attrs != null && attrs.equals(attrs)","rationale":"Attrs should be equal to itself, confirming reflexivity of equals.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.067883456Z"}
{"id":"cee6f733-24bb-4dd4-993b-2ab645cafd61","expr":"attrs != null","rationale":"The method parameter attrs is expected to be non-null because it is immediately passed to other visitAttribute methods, implying it must be a valid Attribute instance.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.067580836Z"}
{"id":"6e1eb336-9902-4f4d-8bea-f0b3fa3699b1","expr":"attrs.getName() != null","rationale":"Attributes usually carry names that identify them, so the getName() method is expected to return a non-null string at this point.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.067580836Z"}
{"id":"bba358d8-b9c2-49a6-82f0-949a95d2c4b2","expr":"!attrs.getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"Even if the name is non-null, it should be non-empty for a meaningful attribute.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.067580836Z"}
{"id":"391b85a9-73d1-4f41-b9dc-1b651c4ff570","expr":"attrs.toString().contains(attrs.getName())","rationale":"The toString() of Attribute is expected to contain the attribute's name, so this invariant captures a reasonable string relation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.067580836Z"}
{"id":"7fdd9154-32a2-4108-b9c8-de7b3b51ae0b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned AnnotationVisitor is constructed via a factory method and is unlikely to be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.067434049Z"}
{"id":"61a57c19-5788-4c77-84bb-0cd80cbdc08c","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"Annotation descriptor 'desc' should be a valid non-empty descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.067043564Z"}
