{"id":"a0638f15-f861-4878-a21c-5a9124844f24","expr":"desc.length() > 2","rationale":"The descriptor string should have a length indicating it is not empty or trivially short.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.067043564Z"}
{"id":"207cb37c-7cfe-4e0b-82ab-78bcea640ba8","expr":"owner != null || (name == null && desc == null)","rationale":"Parameters are usually all null or all non-null because of forwarding.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.066655083Z"}
{"id":"c11c7339-121f-426a-bf1d-ad3826942d0f","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"The descriptor string is usually a non-empty valid descriptor at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.068998244Z"}
