{"id":"c4322690-dd2e-46d6-a413-020bf63de64b","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"Method visitAnnotation usually expects a non-null descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.070321125Z"}
{"id":"367d3ae9-c574-4732-a7ff-d4571d6e67d9","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"The descriptor string typically represents an annotation type, which is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.070321125Z"}
{"id":"e867c98a-c0b7-4295-9cb0-35ba87928e49","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"Boolean parameter visible can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.068998244Z"}
{"id":"6a0fa37a-7b4e-48a0-a65b-d8de9453bdea","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"typePath can be null or have a non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.068998244Z"}
{"id":"fbac18e4-1d08-4ec2-8fee-e8c32143991c","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.getStep(0) >= 0","rationale":"If typePath is not null, its first step is usually a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.068998244Z"}
{"id":"8746097e-6f0b-49b3-8f6f-73f9e82009ba","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Result is constructed by a static factory method that combines results of visitAnnotation calls, which presumably do not return null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.070665884Z"}
{"id":"c5bcd8ed-1dd5-4e87-8144-f7a5a438ba6e","expr":"result.toString() != null","rationale":"Result is a valid object and likely has a non-null string representation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.070665884Z"}
{"id":"ec62ac5b-5dd6-43db-840a-7bc5441f3726","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method calls visitAttribute on other objects using attr, so attr must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.071221270Z"}
{"id":"d346f8dd-831c-4c14-914f-eccb4e629816","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a primitive boolean parameter and can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.070321125Z"}
{"id":"fd736a04-9442-4e6f-ab87-9f8823c34b57","expr":"!desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"Method visitAnnotation should be called with a non-empty descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.070321125Z"}
{"id":"24229329-2ad7-4007-8d66-c27e30910c89","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The attribute parameter is expected to be non-null when the visitAttribute method is called.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.070873425Z"}
{"id":"8d6a9c38-d846-4303-8ea6-49b5cbe6c252","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method expects a valid descriptor string for the annotation type, which is not null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.072026906Z"}
{"id":"65521db3-1f72-4e2e-8972-735a7d6ef500","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"If typePath is present, it has a non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.072026906Z"}
