{"id":"b20b0fe7-032d-4088-8e01-ab15591fa23e","expr":"source == debug || source != debug","rationale":"source and debug are both passed to target.visitSource, so they might sometimes be equal or different.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.074979485Z"}
{"id":"91b1f5e2-dbdb-4fb6-9be9-9890f49f4f08","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"The descriptor 'desc' is expected to be a valid JVM type descriptor string representing an annotation type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.075885511Z"}
{"id":"88c0ca7a-f7bd-4da5-a058-754889318ae9","expr":"source == null || source.length() > 0","rationale":"The source string when not null is likely non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.074857937Z"}
{"id":"24f75d2b-6bf2-42ea-b61f-6753329d642d","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() > 0","rationale":"The debug string when not null is likely non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.074857937Z"}
{"id":"911b5b58-ec11-4a43-8500-3c4f4fbc67e4","expr":"(source == null) == (debug == null)","rationale":"Often source and debug are both null or both non-null when passed as parameters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.074857937Z"}
{"id":"20af9d39-035a-4b56-8625-2e48084a1f42","expr":"result != null || result == null","rationale":"The returned result depends on the delegate call; no specific non-null guarantee is given.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.076104594Z"}
{"id":"4752bfbc-9125-41e1-951c-c16a6b40fb5e","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"The 'visible' parameter is boolean, it must be either true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.075885511Z"}
{"id":"774b0673-a640-4135-9463-ac2de8d6fa39","expr":"source == null || source.length() >= 0","rationale":"source is a String, so if not null, length is >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.074979485Z"}
{"id":"4f3e3e70-337e-41ac-a059-a74fef7a7fd5","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"debug is a String, so if not null, length is >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.074979485Z"}
{"id":"d3047216-34a6-450a-bd09-04f354e201b2","expr":"owner != null && name != null && desc != null","rationale":"All parameters are non-null to safely delegate the call.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.075135048Z"}
{"id":"9e86cc6d-225c-41e8-b11f-77802b839f84","expr":"!owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"Owner string is expected to be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.075135048Z"}
{"id":"89aed791-7eac-437b-987d-9188432f82c8","expr":"!name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Name string is expected to be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.075135048Z"}
