{"id":"11bf034f-56f9-42c9-ba77-033981d3e90c","expr":"debug == null || debug.trim().length() <= debug.length()","rationale":"Calling trim() removes whitespace, so trimmed length can't exceed original length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.074979485Z"}
{"id":"468bfa4b-3d92-4f6b-aec5-fe49b75b7088","expr":"(source != null && debug != null) || (source == null && debug == null) || (source != debug)","rationale":"If both are not null, they are not literally the same string object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.074857937Z"}
{"id":"1fececd0-bfaa-46e5-9e1d-3dc476e2e335","expr":"attr != null && attr.getName() != null && !attr.getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"The attribute is expected to have a valid name when visitAttribute is called.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.077190358Z"}
{"id":"ad4cc6fe-3324-418b-bc44-a9ba7eff0660","expr":"attr.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"The length of the attribute data should be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.077190358Z"}
{"id":"943c63e2-d795-40ab-bc4e-153a5c7b2d93","expr":"attr.getOffset() >= 0","rationale":"Attribute offset indicating start in bytecode or data should be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.077190358Z"}
{"id":"26991806-1612-4211-9ad9-db0ce656b966","expr":"desc.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"Descriptor string starts with '(' as per method descriptor format.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.075135048Z"}
{"id":"967702a2-fa5f-45e4-a855-5845a1e1fb88","expr":"desc.contains(\")\")","rationale":"Descriptor string contains ')' indicating valid method signature.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.075135048Z"}
{"id":"fe8ec2fd-d18f-4147-9765-71c3b5c70be8","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The attr parameter should not be null to allow safe forwarding of the method call.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.077578699Z"}
{"id":"9874698a-dfcd-4a7d-84c7-a1589ab6ba52","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Inner class names are typically non-null and non-empty when being visited.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.078198376Z"}
{"id":"eb9f4ebe-0aa0-43db-a3f2-b160cb20c75c","expr":"outerName == null || !outerName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Because inner classes may or may not have an outer class, outerName is possibly null or a valid non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.078198376Z"}
{"id":"667e411b-9988-4a70-8947-8f40be070006","expr":"innerName != null && !innerName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The inner class's short name is usually non-null and non-empty when visiting.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.078198376Z"}
{"id":"97e66521-9e39-478d-b31b-e7cd8193e7c1","expr":"(access & 0xFFFFF) >= 0","rationale":"The access flags represent modifiers and should be a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.078198376Z"}
{"id":"79347e1b-18b0-406c-8fb7-7e92ca56a247","expr":"name.startsWith(outerName) || outerName == null","rationale":"Inner class names often include the outer class's name as a prefix, or outerName can be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.078198376Z"}
{"id":"b190cb74-682c-4a02-89c1-f21cc3f05d31","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The field 'name' is expected to be a valid identifier string, so it is not null and not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.078892853Z"}
{"id":"e2890208-9802-48b5-949e-b0e662abaf18","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"The descriptor ('desc') describes the type of the field and should always be a valid non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.078892853Z"}
{"id":"91b3021a-a990-4d87-8648-2e198d792ad1","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty() && innerName != null && !innerName.isEmpty() && (outerName == null || !outerName.isEmpty())","rationale":"name and innerName are typically non-null, non-empty strings representing class names; outerName can be null or a valid non-empty name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.078922409Z"}
{"id":"92db5cb8-6c59-465c-94e7-afb3224e03b8","expr":"(outerName != null) == (innerName != null)","rationale":"innerName and outerName tend to be both null or both non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.078922409Z"}
{"id":"1a7ce973-48dc-44ee-939e-348ad95465a3","expr":"(signature == null || !signature.isEmpty())","rationale":"Signature may be null or a valid non-empty string describing generic types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.078892853Z"}
{"id":"dc1583e5-c21e-468a-9f49-0dc1761b4b2c","expr":"(access & 0xFFFF) == access","rationale":"The access modifier parameter fits within expected bit range for access flags.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.078892853Z"}
{"id":"be7e6c01-b03f-4486-beb4-a505670efe3f","expr":"target == null || target.getClass() != null","rationale":"If target is non-null, its getClass() method returns a non-null Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassTransformer#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.079419014Z"}
{"id":"e61e24af-f70f-4b99-932b-1706533c82d2","expr":"(access & 0x1000) == 0","rationale":"The synthetic access flag is typically not set in access at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.078922409Z"}
{"id":"cef05e97-0023-41f7-b3fb-af7eb18c7e0a","expr":"result != null || result == null","rationale":"Since result is returned from target.visitField, it may or may not be null depending on target implementation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.079523090Z"}
{"id":"25f41356-da4f-4711-86a3-f18681d44635","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Method names in Java cannot be empty or null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.079826391Z"}
