{"id":"78a79bf2-13d8-4b41-af00-02ca440c87c4","expr":"local != null || nLocal == 0","rationale":"If nLocal is zero, then local might be null; else local is non-null for accessing local variables.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.086856427Z"}
