{"id":"305d0893-8274-47e3-93af-b883dbfc5d84","expr":"(opcode == 16) == (operand >= -128 && operand <= 127)","rationale":"When opcode is 16 (BIPUSH), operand fits in signed byte range; otherwise, no implication.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.094366366Z"}
{"id":"c7fe25a3-9276-42a5-bdc7-2f33d74f7886","expr":"(opcode == 16) || (opcode == 17) || (opcode == 188) || (opcode == 132)","rationale":"Opcode should be one of the standard opcodes used with integer operand instructions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.094472276Z"}
{"id":"9c10787e-1559-49d8-9d56-99004ffa3bd1","expr":"opcode != 17 || (operand >= -32768 && operand <= 32767)","rationale":"If opcode is 17 (SIPUSH), operand must fit in 16-bit signed short range.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.094366366Z"}
{"id":"fb3e83a9-377f-4490-9b27-f250eae0be72","expr":"!(opcode == 188) || (operand >= 4 && operand <= 11)","rationale":"If the opcode equals NEWARRAY (188), then the operand represents array type and must be in [4,11].","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.094472276Z"}
{"id":"c9f342c6-7f74-4a57-8b4c-51a1b6c7584a","expr":"(opcode != 132) || (operand >= 0 && operand <= 65535)","rationale":"When opcode is IINC, operand must be a valid local variable index (non-negative).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.094472276Z"}
{"id":"f991330b-1366-4e45-a2d6-eece28fb3478","expr":"opcode >= 0 && opcode <= 255","rationale":"Opcode is expected to be within the range of bytecode instructions, which fit in 0 to 255.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.098109925Z"}
{"id":"4d175b4a-b757-46f8-b39e-816180bc41a5","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"The local variable index used by visitVarInsn is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.098109925Z"}
{"id":"350c68fc-4146-49d3-82a2-8284a06df40e","expr":"var <= 65535","rationale":"Variable indices are typically constrained to fit in 16 bits.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.098109925Z"}
