{"id":"46eeda2e-3dad-4a81-8ac5-ee48f046e101","expr":"(opcode < 54) == (var >= 0)","rationale":"Opcode less than 54 implies a variable instruction with valid var index; otherwise var may not be relevant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.098109925Z"}
{"id":"82e70930-2b18-438e-824a-b82a7a128d42","expr":"opcode >= 0 && opcode <= 255","rationale":"Opcode is an opcode value for visitVarInsn, so it should be within the valid bytecode range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.098479490Z"}
{"id":"2319b1a3-80c7-46f4-862e-1b5f8f31dce3","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"Variable index should be non-negative as it refers to local variable slots.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.098479490Z"}
{"id":"21803c21-7a45-462a-ad46-8364695db153","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"desc represents a type descriptor and should not be null or empty when this method is called.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.098674207Z"}
{"id":"d5e15094-133e-408b-b2fa-ab25396b830e","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"opcode should be a valid JVM opcode integer, which is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.098674207Z"}
{"id":"effa0b10-a808-443c-ada9-0d197ae46191","expr":"desc.equals(desc.trim())","rationale":"The descriptor string should not have surrounding whitespace to be a valid type descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.098674207Z"}
{"id":"445bc9a5-2b86-4a2a-a49e-6d118dd25601","expr":"desc != null && desc.length() > 0","rationale":"Typically, the desc parameter represents a type descriptor, which should be a non-null, non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.098834288Z"}
