{"id":"98578086-d220-48a6-881e-5e5d2de540fe","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"owner represents the method owner, typically a non-null valid internal class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.100915988Z"}
{"id":"2b545347-f6c2-4d95-9d72-b798cafef8db","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'owner' string should be a valid JVM internal class name, which is non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.100950132Z"}
{"id":"cc412b55-764b-4c01-b72a-fc1d3eeda6b8","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Method names are expected to be legitimate non-null, non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.100950132Z"}
