{"id":"d476f85d-ee24-46de-9bc7-29aa0b3cac0c","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcodes are expected to be numeric codes representing instructions, usually non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.100950132Z"}
