{"id":"ecddb0f7-5ce1-419c-bd08-05dcff25457a","expr":"opcode >= 0 && opcode <= 255","rationale":"The opcode is likely a valid JVM bytecode instruction opcode.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.105062575Z"}
