{"id":"012140be-76e8-4e59-9b48-0d7a8337dd8a","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode parameter represents a JVM instruction opcode which is typically non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.105811194Z"}
