{"id":"e121e05d-eb95-49f0-9980-a3ad22ec95b1","expr":"opcode <= 200","rationale":"Opcode is within a typical range of JVM bytecodes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.105934967Z"}
{"id":"7cf2d295-fa56-4fbe-b2fd-bb6100da7d09","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The method calls visitLabel on mv1 and mv2 with label, so label must not be null for them to process it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.106627731Z"}
