{"id":"85d95549-553b-4716-9bfd-151e12b05eca","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"In Java bytecode, the variable index (var) typically represents a local variable and is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.109654380Z"}
{"id":"57c85578-5b79-4062-83fa-77406c5f2b53","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"visitIincInsn is used to increment a local variable by a non-zero amount; zero increment would be redundant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.109654380Z"}
{"id":"5a1ea7c4-5b95-4aee-8424-3294892bc7ae","expr":"Math.abs(increment) <= 32767","rationale":"The increment operand in bytecode is a signed 16-bit value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.109654380Z"}
{"id":"171d2292-9d2d-48b2-90ac-115c61599751","expr":"var <= 65535","rationale":"The var index should fit within the range of a 16-bit unsigned index used in JVM bytecode.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.109654380Z"}
{"id":"bc3db55d-f768-42a6-8c35-6e8bb095d925","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"In JVM bytecode, variable indices are non-negative integers, so var should be >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.110815085Z"}
{"id":"11e96e6c-c290-47f5-8f03-88241bd686f1","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"The increment argument in visitIincInsn typically represents a non-zero increment to a local variable.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.110815085Z"}
{"id":"4f9637f0-fc28-42df-b6ff-3073cadb6ab9","expr":"increment >= -128 && increment <= 127","rationale":"The increment value must fit in a signed byte, as the JVM iinc instruction encodes increment as a signed byte.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.110815085Z"}
{"id":"be9a7378-354a-4569-849c-f0f0dce0cec3","expr":"labels != null && labels.length == (max - min + 1)","rationale":"The number of labels should equal the range from min to max plus one, matching the method signature semantics.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.111363197Z"}
{"id":"d4523442-e4c6-468e-9f2d-97b4b6c90f02","expr":"max >= min","rationale":"For a valid table switch range, max should be greater or equal to min.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.111363197Z"}
{"id":"9bc62b2c-62e9-4cc3-b75b-9308b6c7eaeb","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label should not be null as it is required to handle out-of-range values.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.111363197Z"}
{"id":"e34769b4-15df-42ba-a3dd-344ecdbc8377","expr":"min <= max","rationale":"Ensures that the given range for the table switch indices is valid and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.111687929Z"}
{"id":"0e7c4c56-51d8-42ae-9fa9-9ab5ab89f008","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The instruction requires an array of labels for the switch cases, so labels must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.111687929Z"}
{"id":"c4063103-c5d4-4689-a50b-b9236bc5b1ff","expr":"labels.length == max - min + 1","rationale":"The labels array length must exactly cover the range from min to max inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.111687929Z"}
{"id":"43c8f54d-eb12-427f-b4b1-2c5641d7456f","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label indicates where to jump if none of the switch cases match, so it must exist.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.111687929Z"}
{"id":"4609af13-fabc-4ce7-be2d-8448a56a0c39","expr":"keys != null && labels != null && keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"keys and labels arrays must be non-null and of equal length as they represent matched pairs in the lookup switch instruction.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.112745089Z"}
{"id":"f45df6c6-c9f7-401e-9de9-043094a43a9b","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label must be non-null as it is required for the switch instruction.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.112745089Z"}
{"id":"961b834e-7c14-4d62-a238-7164a856d1de","expr":"dims >= 1","rationale":"dims parameter should be at least 1 since visitMultiANewArrayInsn requires one or more dimensions","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.112822404Z"}
{"id":"f3177a0d-7efb-4dbb-a59f-00bee6158fe4","expr":"desc.charAt(0) == '['","rationale":"desc should be an array type descriptor, which always starts with '['","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.112822404Z"}
{"id":"e874ae0b-73ef-4c3f-ab13-640bcd936cc6","expr":"dims <= desc.length()","rationale":"dims cannot exceed the length of desc string","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.112822404Z"}
{"id":"ea5e31b5-2432-455f-8d31-6d08ba00e7ca","expr":"dims > 0","rationale":"dims is the number of dimensions, which must be positive for a multi-array allocation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.112777179Z"}
{"id":"e6b4637f-93fa-4ab0-8bf1-b5bda04f9cc3","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc must be non-null to specify the array type descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.112777179Z"}
{"id":"fdbb44da-82bd-4cc0-b676-3131be5a68b8","expr":"keys != null && labels != null && dflt != null && keys.length == labels.length + 1","rationale":"The method semantics require that keys and labels length relationship is maintained.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.113199454Z"}
{"id":"b09b9069-d334-4ded-a3a2-1e7d892ab23b","expr":"keys.length == labels.length + 1","rationale":"Length relationship between keys and labels array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.113199454Z"}
{"id":"934c6a19-90ad-48bc-bb8b-752989462e63","expr":"keys.length >= 1","rationale":"Keys array must have at least one element.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.113199454Z"}
