{"id":"d02137ff-5a94-4803-9144-9f9c422cd2f7","expr":"start != handler && end != handler","rationale":"Handler label should be distinct from start and end labels to properly handle exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.115403955Z"}
{"id":"1ff861bd-4949-45e4-9d8d-08ccb114d36e","expr":"type == null || type.length() > 0","rationale":"When type is not null, it should be a non-empty string representing the exception class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.115403955Z"}
{"id":"87566319-f57d-4992-a0f3-3419174965be","expr":"start != null && end != null && handler != null && (type == null || type != null)","rationale":"The labels must be non-null as they are used in visitTryCatchBlock calls; the type can be null indicating a catch-all handler.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.116872980Z"}
{"id":"05989245-06b5-4c92-a8d5-bfb00370dd29","expr":"start != end","rationale":"The start and end labels should not be identical to define a valid try range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.116872980Z"}
{"id":"34a0c0f4-5ea2-4878-9646-2a82b79b561d","expr":"!start.equals(handler) && !end.equals(handler)","rationale":"The handler label is usually distinct from start and end labels as it marks the catch block start.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.116872980Z"}
{"id":"f750701e-1e59-4ec7-a825-28df55a41d6e","expr":"type == null || !type.isEmpty()","rationale":"If a type is provided, it should not be empty; null represents a catch-all handler.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.116872980Z"}
{"id":"84fe1f5f-3385-41bb-9ab7-2f376c7e173e","expr":"start.compareTo(end) <= 0","rationale":"The start label should come before or be equal to the end label in the bytecode order.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.116872980Z"}
{"id":"f5a5a3d0-2bf7-4772-827b-3d30007fc8d7","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Local variable name is expected to be a valid identifier, usually non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.117160272Z"}
{"id":"c8eb1c32-348f-47d8-ba07-738c71ef91d2","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"desc parameter describes the type and should be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.117160272Z"}
{"id":"5465cb9b-e2cb-4a5b-bf28-31cfcd697e22","expr":"start != null && end != null","rationale":"Both start and end labels define the scope in bytecode and must be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.117160272Z"}
{"id":"20adb8c8-917b-49a9-a118-79b824708652","expr":"start.equals(end) || start.compareTo(end) < 0","rationale":"The variable’s scope starts at 'start' and ends at 'end', so start should not come after end.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.117160272Z"}
{"id":"c88f17b1-509e-4f97-b642-474faef01ca5","expr":"signature == null || signature.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"If signature is non-null, it likely follows a method signature format starting with '('.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.117477138Z"}
{"id":"36d5e6e2-b26e-477b-932d-d716e458e843","expr":"start != end","rationale":"The start and end labels for the local variable scope are expected to be different, since the variable must have a non-empty live range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:15.117477138Z"}
