{"id":"d5f65622-2bd5-4870-acec-3e9101721f34","expr":"keys != null && callback != null && keys.length >= 0","rationale":"Parameters keys and callback are input parameters, expected to be non-null based on typical usage patterns; keys.length is non-negative by Java array property.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.194491159Z"}
