{"id":"adbf8dfd-5134-48cc-b5d7-34cb1ca5c231","expr":"keys.length == 0 || (keys[keys.length - 1] - keys[0] + 1) > 0","rationale":"Density denominator keys[keys.length - 1] - keys[0] + 1 must be positive to avoid division by zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.194491159Z"}
{"id":"c34b9ceb-d4a4-4d13-82c8-aa86a1884d06","expr":"keys.length == 0 || keys.length > 0 && keys[keys.length - 1] >= keys[0]","rationale":"Because density is computed using keys length and range, keys must have keys[keys.length - 1] >= keys[0] when length > 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.207297660Z"}
{"id":"8ee81bb4-e8e9-49e1-a815-522f6729efe9","expr":"keys.length >= 0","rationale":"Array keys length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.207297660Z"}
{"id":"736992e4-2cf8-4428-8d0d-a618a3224348","expr":"callback != null","rationale":"callback is used as an argument for process_switch, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.207297660Z"}
{"id":"14a3cb5a-b9ab-456a-8619-3260222b717d","expr":"!(keys.length > 0) || (keys[keys.length - 1] - keys[0] + 1) >= keys.length","rationale":"Because density is (float keys.length divided by the range), the range must be at least keys.length if keys is not empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.207297660Z"}
{"id":"c7dcada5-c10b-4795-bc0a-57bb385e6512","expr":"callback != null","rationale":"callback is likely required and not null for processing.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.208559856Z"}
{"id":"09427661-56f0-491d-87ee-9fa6145202a4","expr":"useTable == true || useTable == false","rationale":"useTable is a boolean parameter, so it is either true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.208559856Z"}
{"id":"ee3461ef-a625-4bee-bbd7-6ba316db8c87","expr":"keys.length >= 0","rationale":"An array length in Java is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.208559856Z"}
{"id":"7e518b7a-b9e3-41d8-848a-720257478207","expr":"keys.length >= 0","rationale":"keys is an array, so its length is always >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.208813233Z"}
{"id":"3fd8192f-6c86-4287-985e-7f49a463d89d","expr":"callback != null","rationale":"Callback is passed and used for processing, so it should not be null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.208813233Z"}
{"id":"cf7dc90d-2319-4091-a1df-75fe76ff252e","expr":"(keys.length == 0) || (keys[0] <= keys[keys.length - 1])","rationale":"keys is sorted ascending, so first element is <= last element if length > 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.208813233Z"}
{"id":"d942568a-7092-4a8e-b847-b40ac102a7bd","expr":"keys == null || keys.length == 0 || keys[0] <= keys[keys.length - 1]","rationale":"If keys has elements, the first element is less or equal to the last element due to sorting requirement.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.208559856Z"}
{"id":"89450c09-3a8a-4f3f-a7a0-669e92a663dd","expr":"keys != null && keys.length >= 0","rationale":"The array keys must be non-null and have a non-negative length because it is an input parameter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#isSorted(int[]):boolean","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.208891270Z"}
{"id":"291b8e33-2147-4b87-af07-806871dcb440","expr":"(useTable && keys.length > 0) || (!useTable && keys.length >= 0)","rationale":"When useTable is true and keys length > 0, table-switch was used, else lookup-switch used.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#process_switch(int[],ProcessSwitchCallback,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.208813233Z"}
{"id":"61128bb2-d8d9-4e18-ab3e-779135df9058","expr":"keys.length == 0 || keys.length == 1 || keys[0] <= keys[1]","rationale":"If keys has at least two elements, the first two must be in non-decreasing order for the array to be possibly sorted.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#isSorted(int[]):boolean","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.208891270Z"}
{"id":"1402a7eb-fc56-471e-8898-60b8d664ea05","expr":"keys.length == 0 || keys.length == 1 || keys[0] <= keys[keys.length - 1]","rationale":"For a sorted array, the first element is less or equal to the last element.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#isSorted(int[]):boolean","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.208891270Z"}
{"id":"81c19e7b-6a3f-4f5c-941c-07d34e539d1b","expr":"keys.length == 0 && result == true || keys.length > 0","rationale":"If the array is empty, the result is always true, consistent with an empty array being trivially sorted.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#isSorted(int[]):boolean","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.210420680Z"}
{"id":"a086b631-3158-44a3-afbb-4ec154ab8ecb","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The method 'mark' uses 'label' directly, so 'label' should not be null at the method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#mark(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.217954434Z"}
{"id":"a3186af9-359f-49b7-b475-5cbb187f1cf3","expr":"label.isResolved() == false","rationale":"Before the mark method executes, the label likely hasn't been resolved yet, so it is not resolved.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#mark(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.217954434Z"}
{"id":"dea85fe2-297a-4a6b-b48b-c89c282735c8","expr":"label.position >= 0 || label.position == -1","rationale":"The label's position field, if accessible, usually is -1 when unset or a non-negative value; at method entry position is likely -1 or some non-negative value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#mark(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.217954434Z"}
{"id":"a3bd4b9a-5d8d-4797-8ab0-70637ff51906","expr":"label.labels == null || label.labels.length >= 0","rationale":"If accessible, the labels array is either null or has length >= 0. This invariant captures the valid state of the label's internal label array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#mark(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.217954434Z"}
