{"id":"10d846af-b955-4903-b749-b4166c5bcec1","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The method calls mv.visitLabel(label), so label should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#mark(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.221852824Z"}
{"id":"5e9d832f-f4ea-4587-ad46-93d8906cda67","expr":"label.position >= 0","rationale":"After visiting label, its position is set to a non-negative value.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#mark(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.221852824Z"}
{"id":"5fd1066d-839b-4fec-9056-1f38d4ac4e5d","expr":"!label.firstInGroup || label.position >= 0","rationale":"If label is the first in a group, it is marked and position is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#mark(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.221852824Z"}
