{"id":"cb004c6a-e628-4ab3-a9d8-79f2d0dcd4f2","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The type parameter must be non-null since the method creates a new instance and invokes its constructor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#throw_exception(Type,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.240569112Z"}
