{"id":"a31b000d-dee2-45e4-8aab-24ac7fa2c934","expr":"method != null && method.getClassInfo() != null && method.getClassInfo().getType() != null","rationale":"At method entry, method and its nested objects should be non-null because they are used in the subsequent invoke call.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke(MethodInfo):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.285261897Z"}
{"id":"462df339-a59c-4382-946f-4eea05543b2a","expr":"method.getClassInfo().getType().isInterface() == false","rationale":"The type obtained from ClassInfo is expected to be a concrete class, not an interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke(MethodInfo):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.285261897Z"}
{"id":"7a0b0ded-284c-4730-b6d2-ee6d465688dd","expr":"method.getClassInfo().getType().getModifiers() >= 0","rationale":"Modifiers are typically non-negative bit flags.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke(MethodInfo):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.285261897Z"}
{"id":"8247c591-0cb1-47cb-97ec-561791aa6e35","expr":"method.getSignature() != null","rationale":"A MethodInfo instance should have a non-null signature ready for invocation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke(MethodInfo):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.285261897Z"}
{"id":"574c6137-27ce-47b3-911c-198ffd5913e7","expr":"method != null && method.getClassInfo() != null && method.getClassInfo().getType() != null","rationale":"method and its associated classInfo and type are non-null because they are used as arguments in the invoke call.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke(MethodInfo):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.288147360Z"}
{"id":"bad10f76-7ed2-40e1-90a7-106bbe63cd13","expr":"method.getClassInfo().getType().isAssignableFrom(method.getClassInfo().getType())","rationale":"The type returned by getType should be assignable to itself.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke(MethodInfo):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.288147360Z"}
{"id":"282333d0-e555-47a0-a607-d3b2d49f0b5e","expr":"method.getClassInfo().getMethods().contains(method)","rationale":"The method object should be present in the list of methods of its declared classInfo.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke(MethodInfo):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.288147360Z"}
{"id":"521ad7b2-a5c4-4b1c-a7e3-0fe0fe0ff6f7","expr":"method.getModifiers() == method.getModifiers()","rationale":"The modifiers of a method should be consistent throughout the method execution.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke(MethodInfo):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.288147360Z"}
{"id":"bf9b81fd-15c9-4e76-be3a-5eabadd9c5d0","expr":"method.getName() != null && !method.getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"The method name should be non-null and non-empty at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke(MethodInfo):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.288147360Z"}
{"id":"c034f6bd-a463-4888-a444-8477847d4859","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns the classInfo field, which is likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getClassInfo():ClassInfo","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.295740295Z"}
{"id":"4bb13eee-3064-4c0e-b929-fc96497e77a0","expr":"result.getClassName() != null","rationale":"ClassInfo usually contains a class name that should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getClassInfo():ClassInfo","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.295740295Z"}
{"id":"ed77b312-4b2e-4fa6-a2e1-d09624f1796b","expr":"result.isInterface() == false","rationale":"ClassInfo's isInterface method returns boolean, and it's plausible the returned class info is not an interface.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getClassInfo():ClassInfo","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.295740295Z"}
{"id":"a0cc92a7-0c4c-4597-91a4-0816af133065","expr":"result.getModifiers() >= 0","rationale":"Modifiers are integer flags, non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getClassInfo():ClassInfo","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.295740295Z"}
{"id":"4a7d0085-bafd-4117-a20c-b73c9c5481f8","expr":"result >= 0","rationale":"Typically, modifier values are non-negative bit flags.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getModifiers():int","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.297671531Z"}
{"id":"407ef114-f1d5-4d9f-a056-08de7884aca5","expr":"Integer.bitCount(result) <= Integer.SIZE","rationale":"Result is an int, so number of set bits is at most Integer.SIZE.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getModifiers():int","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.297671531Z"}
{"id":"4114ae92-c1a0-47d1-ab2c-903343075e4a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns the exceptionTypes array field, it is likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getExceptionTypes():Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.310581598Z"}
{"id":"1562f895-b85d-4280-91f4-d5a57c169ab1","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"The result is an array, so its length must be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getExceptionTypes():Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.310581598Z"}
{"id":"0619dd9d-4508-4c22-aff3-4c4c2a81d884","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns the stored classInfo field, which is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.State#getClassInfo():ClassInfo","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.318685756Z"}
{"id":"22b364e3-6c18-494e-b1fd-8bbb907272bc","expr":"result >= 0","rationale":"The returned modifiers value is non-negative as it's a bitmask.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.State#getModifiers():int","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.320473762Z"}
{"id":"d607b128-d885-4b97-86c5-6734849e3e1c","expr":"(result & 1) == 0 || (result & 1) == 1","rationale":"The least significant bit may represent the 'public' modifier, so it's either set or not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.State#getModifiers():int","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.320473762Z"}
{"id":"2b58fe50-709f-4587-abf8-73856412e5cf","expr":"(result & 0x10) == 0 || (result & 0x10) == 0x10","rationale":"The 'final' modifier bit may be 0 or 1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.State#getModifiers():int","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.320473762Z"}
{"id":"4fdd6956-d20b-4628-a405-3d188c1f8f43","expr":"(result & 0x20) == 0 || (result & 0x20) == 0x20","rationale":"The 'static' modifier bit may be 0 or 1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.State#getModifiers():int","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.320473762Z"}
{"id":"9a2146d8-6b1f-4c3f-bfcc-cbf5a0ac6ddb","expr":"(result & 0x40) == 0 || (result & 0x40) == 0x40","rationale":"The 'synchronized' modifier bit may be 0 or 1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.State#getModifiers():int","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.320473762Z"}
{"id":"3d9024c6-f3fe-4d71-a53b-e400d488ca4c","expr":"c != null && t != null && c.size() >= 0","rationale":"Method expects a non-null collection and transformer; collection size is never negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#bucket(Collection,Transformer):Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.320944188Z"}
{"id":"342e8896-851e-4f7c-9500-0cf5c17a557f","expr":"!c.contains(null)","rationale":"Assuming typical usage where collection does not contain null elements as transformation might not handle null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#bucket(Collection,Transformer):Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.320944188Z"}
{"id":"c99058f3-e070-4837-8bd1-f765513a12eb","expr":"(c.isEmpty() && t != null) || (!c.isEmpty())","rationale":"If collection is empty nothing to transform; transformer must still be valid if collection is empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#bucket(Collection,Transformer):Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.320944188Z"}
{"id":"d5bc7f26-2cc7-4783-9635-3911a55b0fc9","expr":"t != null","rationale":"Transformer argument must be non-null to use transform method safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#bucket(Collection,Transformer):Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.320944188Z"}
{"id":"515f9364-0afa-4612-81e1-05b2bfdd912c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method creates and returns a new HashMap; thus, result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#bucket(Collection,Transformer):Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.321387834Z"}
{"id":"5d37eee0-cdca-443d-95dd-8cdffa71f65d","expr":"source != null && target != null && source != target","rationale":"The method reverses source map into target, so both should be non-null and distinct.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#reverse(Map,Map):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.321513731Z"}
{"id":"8ec93679-21c3-459d-a29e-bdb62ed74391","expr":"source.keySet().size() == source.size()","rationale":"Before the method executes, the keySet size of source equals its size.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#reverse(Map,Map):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.321513731Z"}
{"id":"bd2b01e8-2ec4-412a-bb64-82661aac9e1b","expr":"!source.isEmpty() || target.isEmpty()","rationale":"Target map is likely empty or unrelated before reversal when source is empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#reverse(Map,Map):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.321513731Z"}
{"id":"20439b41-39a7-44e1-b75e-c710e24a2540","expr":"target.size() >= 0","rationale":"Map size is always non-negative at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#reverse(Map,Map):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.321513731Z"}
{"id":"9b1d0878-3891-4983-ae6f-c34d38653e0a","expr":"source.size() == target.size() || source.size() > target.size()","rationale":"Since keys in source become values in target, duplicate values in source might reduce target size.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#reverse(Map,Map):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.321960061Z"}
{"id":"fe017af6-6f36-4a26-a1f4-ea7260bea20c","expr":"!source.isEmpty() || target.isEmpty()","rationale":"If source has no entries, target is empty after the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#reverse(Map,Map):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.321960061Z"}
{"id":"fcf74d6c-6505-4d48-9b93-3d87c81ff058","expr":"source.values().containsAll(target.keySet())","rationale":"Target keys are inverted source values.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#reverse(Map,Map):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.321960061Z"}
{"id":"c9019887-90a5-442a-8bea-20110fc3f297","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The Signature returned by getSignature() should never be null, as it is directly retrieved from a valid state object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.State#getSignature():Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.322185786Z"}
{"id":"db05188c-0b01-4bee-a9dd-f661a2ff2556","expr":"c != null && p != null && c.isEmpty() == false || c.isEmpty() == true","rationale":"Method filter requires parameters c and p to be non-null to perform removeIf and predicate evaluation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#filter(Collection,Predicate):Collection","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.323165370Z"}
{"id":"5fcbe55d-86f7-42bc-bf21-57d0baa4e518","expr":"p.getClass().isInstance(p)","rationale":"p is expected to be a valid Predicate instance before filtering.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#filter(Collection,Predicate):Collection","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.323165370Z"}
{"id":"4f3077f9-4e6f-4e50-8c58-efd1e63649b6","expr":"result == c","rationale":"At method exit, the returned collection is the same as the input collection reference.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#filter(Collection,Predicate):Collection","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.323319050Z"}
{"id":"9c3c02c6-eeba-43bb-82a5-1e2fa4fd8532","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned collection is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#filter(Collection,Predicate):Collection","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.323319050Z"}
{"id":"e2763696-66b7-4047-96a1-5974efa43f7f","expr":"c != null && t != null && !c.isEmpty() && c.size() >= 0","rationale":"At method entry, c and t must be non-null for the method to execute as shown; c.size() is used to initialize the result list size.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#transform(Collection,Transformer):List","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.323713031Z"}
{"id":"d9b6b011-38db-4c3c-a7cd-5eb4ee6e2f48","expr":"c != null && t != null","rationale":"c and t are used to create the result list and in the loop, so both must be non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#transform(Collection,Transformer):List","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.323713031Z"}
{"id":"df55204c-b597-4f7e-b3f9-301758fe28e6","expr":"c != null && c.size() >= 0","rationale":"The size method of Collection is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#transform(Collection,Transformer):List","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.323713031Z"}
{"id":"f6b869db-8d70-4195-81cd-69a3cd134abb","expr":"c != null && c.iterator() != null && t != null","rationale":"c.iterator() must not return null for the loop to proceed; t must be non-null for transform call.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#transform(Collection,Transformer):List","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.323713031Z"}
{"id":"82dfe91f-ed06-4e26-bb55-2b31d669f5a6","expr":"t != null","rationale":"t.transform is called inside the method, so t must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#transform(Collection,Transformer):List","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.323713031Z"}
{"id":"9e087632-351f-4ca2-a133-890a9c9c687d","expr":"result.size() == c.size()","rationale":"The result list size equals the input collection size.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#transform(Collection,Transformer):List","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.323962290Z"}
{"id":"9ce8a284-d341-4fa7-b288-68064f5d2626","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The result list reference is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#transform(Collection,Transformer):List","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.323962290Z"}
{"id":"b2c6f7d4-74cf-40aa-a46d-7368034fb2d5","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || c.isEmpty()","rationale":"Result emptiness corresponds to input collection emptiness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#transform(Collection,Transformer):List","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.323962290Z"}
{"id":"dd9b7de7-b0b9-495a-a942-b226e0c052a6","expr":"result.size() == list.size()","rationale":"The map result maps each element of list to an index, so their sizes match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#getIndexMap(List):Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.324501496Z"}
{"id":"6ed574b3-539f-4aa5-9519-9741d20aa486","expr":"result.keySet().containsAll(list)","rationale":"Since each element of list is a key in result, result.keySet() contains all list elements.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#getIndexMap(List):Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.324501496Z"}
{"id":"d235a537-9e07-499a-acf1-02dbe006c1fd","expr":"!result.containsValue(-1)","rationale":"Index values in result start from 0 and increase, no negative indices.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#getIndexMap(List):Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.324501496Z"}
{"id":"04eb5bd7-8f63-4453-9794-639d1530e57e","expr":"!list.isEmpty() || result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If the input list is empty, the result map is empty as no elements are indexed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#getIndexMap(List):Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.324501496Z"}
{"id":"ea053fea-d419-404e-8331-f5d550b3dfbf","expr":"list.size() >= 0","rationale":"The size of the list is a non-negative integer, consistent with standard List contracts.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#getIndexMap(List):Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.324362715Z"}
{"id":"03bb7e03-d18c-42d6-ad4f-d8c1da78d438","expr":"list.iterator() != null","rationale":"Calling iterator() on list returns an Iterator object, which should not be null for a valid List.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#getIndexMap(List):Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.324362715Z"}
{"id":"91abe0fc-d500-404d-a518-80af303ca070","expr":"list.contains(null) || !list.contains(null)","rationale":"This is always true, but included to illustrate list content can be examined via contains.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CollectionUtils#getIndexMap(List):Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CollectionUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.324362715Z"}
{"id":"2f838653-7b6a-403e-9953-8bdae25615ee","expr":"methods != null && !methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The generate method iterates through methods, so methods must be non-null and not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.FixedValueGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/FixedValueGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.325096125Z"}
{"id":"d2e48f11-a343-4fc9-adda-1e68d27e19ac","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"ClassEmitter parameter should be non-null for generation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.FixedValueGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/FixedValueGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.325096125Z"}
{"id":"475c7755-a2cc-4674-b91e-91384e867b25","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Context parameter is expected to be non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.FixedValueGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/FixedValueGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.325096125Z"}
{"id":"ae2961ef-d5ad-456b-8c1c-89c18323cf1c","expr":"ce.getClass().getName() != null","rationale":"Ensures ce is a valid ClassEmitter instance with a non-null class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.FixedValueGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/FixedValueGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.325096125Z"}
