{"id":"efe6d8bb-dc1e-4e3b-ab92-c27eff55bb7a","expr":"type != null && sig != null","rationale":"Method getDeclaredMethod requires 'type' to be non-null and 'sig' logically should also be non-null as it is used to invoke the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#find(Class,Signature):MethodProxy","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.342170652Z"}
{"id":"06561bb3-5865-480d-8b92-60c4852da104","expr":"!sig.equals(null)","rationale":"The Signature argument 'sig' is expected to be a valid, non-null Signature instance to use as an argument to the method lookup.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#find(Class,Signature):MethodProxy","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.342170652Z"}
