{"id":"7c99201d-a791-4af2-aa1a-96a07cd437a7","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"callbackTypes array length must be zero or positive","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.346510373Z"}
{"id":"26656268-fb23-43e7-87c6-b0f51ef1ed28","expr":"callbackTypes.length == 0 || callbackTypes[0] != null","rationale":"If callbackTypes has elements, none (especially first) should be null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.346510373Z"}
{"id":"0cade575-e4f6-4f56-b1aa-a1f3e5bdca84","expr":"result != null && result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"The method returns an array of Type objects that correspond to the input callbackTypes array length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.346594241Z"}
{"id":"01ea8d9f-6882-4dc2-b410-c87094d99691","expr":"result.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"The result object is an array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.346594241Z"}
{"id":"a8881522-efbb-47c1-9369-f883c5ddd8f7","expr":"result != null || result == null","rationale":"result may be null or non-null because the method returns an Object value from invocation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#invokeSuper(Object,Object[]):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.347364862Z"}
{"id":"77cad8bc-c5a9-4498-90dd-ff7cb6ecdb88","expr":"result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"The array returned has the same length as the input array callbackTypes per the method implementation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.347803428Z"}
{"id":"96422a6f-6500-42f4-81d2-c0616c277e23","expr":"result != null","rationale":"From the implementation, a new array is always returned and never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.347803428Z"}
{"id":"a2586c64-613d-47c9-a4ea-2bf896ce36c6","expr":"callbacks != null || callbacks == null","rationale":"The callbacks parameter may be null or non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.348718510Z"}
{"id":"3a5f46db-be54-4004-b110-1b81898d2da9","expr":"callbacks == null || callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"An array's length is always non-negative when the array is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.348718510Z"}
{"id":"a656bd34-8d7b-4c0c-9665-a5f7e0a57825","expr":"callbacks == null || !(callbacks.length < 0)","rationale":"Array length cannot be negative, so if callbacks is non-null, length is not less than zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.348718510Z"}
{"id":"8cd5bc2d-5a1e-4630-b77a-43114514255f","expr":"callbacks == null || callbacks.length > 0 || callbacks.length == 0","rationale":"The callbacks array length is always zero or more if callbacks is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.348718510Z"}
{"id":"075210dd-c49e-451f-be51-500345efb448","expr":"callbackTypes != null && callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"The callbackTypes array is expected to be non-null at method entry, and its length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.347939804Z"}
{"id":"57229473-f7da-45d1-983a-a79c7d82bc72","expr":"!checkAll || callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"No constraint links checkAll to callbackTypes length, so this implies a trivial relation capturing the allowed state.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.347939804Z"}
{"id":"fd47a450-062d-4831-a433-85c7f65d739e","expr":"callbackTypes.length == 0 || callbackTypes[0] != null","rationale":"To proceed with type determination, the first callbackType is likely non-null if the array is not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.347939804Z"}
{"id":"93fc519e-9873-4896-be99-14c0f767b4c1","expr":"!(checkAll && callbackTypes.length == 0)","rationale":"If checkAll is true, callbackTypes should not be empty for the method to function meaningfully.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.347939804Z"}
{"id":"56d9a636-a245-4237-b3ba-78835aa49e2c","expr":"result.length == callbacks.length","rationale":"The result array length must be equal to the callbacks array length since each callback produces one Type in the result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.349860981Z"}
{"id":"76c38ab9-ec0f-4859-ae6f-be2459167442","expr":"!checkAll || result != null","rationale":"If checkAll is true, result should be non-null, meaning types have been determined.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.349860981Z"}
{"id":"4bb17158-6a70-49ad-be1b-4da6f798df13","expr":"callbacks == null || (result != null && result.length == callbacks.length)","rationale":"Ensures that if callbacks is non-null, result is initialized and has matching length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.349860981Z"}
{"id":"fd72bda3-41e9-4d47-921f-9af1c6d94d83","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Result array is always non-null as it's newly created before returning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.349860981Z"}
{"id":"34a73659-2fa2-4fde-b9a2-34c4469d14ce","expr":"callbacks != null && callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"The callbacks array length is a non-negative integer and callbacks is likely given as input.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.349029145Z"}
{"id":"a38c9b96-4a54-4f90-8bb2-b32586858f9b","expr":"checkAll == true || checkAll == false","rationale":"checkAll is a boolean parameter; this is trivially true but meaningful for its type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.349029145Z"}
{"id":"3ba3e95c-9e6f-44e5-b327-e61bfaf5654d","expr":"callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"Length of callbacks array cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.349029145Z"}
{"id":"0050012f-cb3a-4189-a6b6-82ad267ee72a","expr":"!checkAll || callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"This expression captures a logical implication form; although trivial, it represents a relationship involving checkAll and callbacks.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.349029145Z"}
{"id":"65fad16d-2ac8-495e-a362-52771e474672","expr":"callbacks.length == (callbacks == null ? 0 : callbacks.length)","rationale":"This is a safe expression asserting the length value of callbacks to help reasoning.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.349029145Z"}
{"id":"b9d79918-cc43-4e98-b9fc-dcf5c165ac4f","expr":"callback != null","rationale":"Method throws exception if callback is null, so callback is always non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.350989576Z"}
{"id":"93bbd2fd-7a09-4db1-a85d-c62bc0ad902c","expr":"checkAll == true || checkAll == false","rationale":"checkAll is a boolean parameter, it can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.350989576Z"}
{"id":"cb9adeaf-b78b-431c-b8f5-f19cb582ba40","expr":"callbackTypes != null && callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"The parameter callbackTypes is expected to be a non-null array, since it is passed to construct an array of the same length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.350074564Z"}
{"id":"a605f5bb-236a-4a1b-8bfd-6c7c2e9e5a2c","expr":"result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"The output array 'result' must have the same length as the input 'callbackTypes' array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.350541042Z"}
{"id":"cc713979-b0b5-4393-9800-adee98ef3747","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The result array is freshly allocated and hence non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.350541042Z"}
{"id":"008cd6f1-0fbd-482c-a680-e151365a9f63","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns the result of determineType(Class, boolean), which should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.352137898Z"}
{"id":"97bbcbaa-3bf8-4ec8-8fda-63e3596d3fac","expr":"!checkAll || result != null","rationale":"Regardless of checkAll, result is assigned the return value which is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.352137898Z"}
{"id":"2aa50694-7bad-4cb9-b530-aa14f9b14fc3","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"callbackType must be non-null since the method checks if classes are assignable from it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.352597263Z"}
{"id":"ac34179f-e56f-4cd1-bee4-eb0909649c2d","expr":"checkAll == true || checkAll == false","rationale":"checkAll is declared as boolean, so it must be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.352597263Z"}
{"id":"3dfad11f-b233-4d97-a081-8666d9b52bc0","expr":"result != null","rationale":"After the method completes successfully, the result Type must be non-null since it's assigned from 'info.type' when a matching callback class is found.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.353407428Z"}
{"id":"61cba621-7fff-4f67-bf8f-391c0971a2a7","expr":"callbackType.isAssignableFrom(result.getClass()) || result.getClass().isAssignableFrom(callbackType)","rationale":"Given the method's logic to find a CallbackInfo whose cls is assignable from callbackType, there is a logical connection between callbackType and the class of result Type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.353407428Z"}
{"id":"af561471-31e5-4a8e-aff2-13b9d044c9bb","expr":"!checkAll || (result != null)","rationale":"If checkAll is false, the method may break earlier, but still result is assigned from a matched callback, so result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.353407428Z"}
{"id":"801bb274-87f7-4c52-9fc8-03b494940cef","expr":"!checkAll || result != null","rationale":"This relates to the control flow: if checkAll is true, the method attempts all callbacks, eventually returning a non-null type if successful.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.353407428Z"}
{"id":"204a0492-a41e-4e86-ad3f-825b298b09fa","expr":"result != null && (callbacks == null || result.length == callbacks.length)","rationale":"The result array likely corresponds to the types of each callback, so its length should match if callbacks is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.350433559Z"}
{"id":"66eaf7f3-a071-4fd3-8fcc-8b0280dcece5","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"Array lengths in Java are always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.350433559Z"}
{"id":"add5e07f-7f30-4419-b41a-ec72a5b44b4a","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"callbackType must not be null to safely call equals in the loop over CALLBACKS.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.353891249Z"}
{"id":"50fe896f-9b30-4bc2-9555-f804746f4721","expr":"methods != null && !methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The generate method processes the methods list to create fields and methods for each, so methods should not be empty at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.353788947Z"}
{"id":"e6bfed27-0998-451b-9f9e-2cf0d7bd1324","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"ClassEmitter is needed to declare fields and end methods, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.353788947Z"}
{"id":"92df2664-fb67-4672-abc1-f1fd9b0103f4","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Context instance is used extensively to get signatures, begin methods, etc., hence non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.353788947Z"}
