{"id":"da28f358-c5b5-4828-aab9-bec5f2e2a39e","expr":"impl.getName().equals(impl.toString().substring(0,impl.getName().length()))","rationale":"Impl.toString likely begins with the method name; thus, getName equals substring of toString.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.360524408Z"}
