{"id":"c971322b-5a4a-4391-9bf3-24666ef97931","expr":"result.startsWith(impl.getName())","rationale":"Since result is impl.getName() + \"$Method\", it starts with impl.getName().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.360735866Z"}
