{"id":"cd8566d7-e9c1-4dbf-842e-b2994c4e32f4","expr":"impl.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"A name that is empty would result in \"$Proxy\", which is less likely; usually names are non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.361121242Z"}
{"id":"55555e28-e311-4b78-af68-a5258ba3821c","expr":"impl.getName().indexOf('$') == -1","rationale":"The method appends '$Proxy'. To avoid confusion, the original name likely does not contain '$'.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.361121242Z"}
