{"id":"3688b7cc-f0a5-4b65-b071-49be9d8deb3e","expr":"sigMap.keySet().size() >= 0","rationale":"The key set size is at least zero since sigMap is a Map.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateFindProxy(ClassEmitter,Map):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.370593175Z"}
