{"id":"52a82cc5-830f-4712-8798-44ec6fc40f6e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always initializes and returns a HashMap instance, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.BridgeMethodResolver#resolveAll():Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/BridgeMethodResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.373197158Z"}
