{"id":"a7a72eb3-db7e-4286-ba29-609c9b54a9c0","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically the 'name' parameter in visit methods represents the method or field name, which is expected to be non-null and not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.BridgeMethodResolver#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/BridgeMethodResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:16.373988137Z"}
