{"id":"3d4adbc3-62d8-42ef-ac49-3709b8f71605","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label must always be provided for the lookup switch instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.259820740Z"}
{"id":"1fd537ea-3e04-4fb8-b463-0071bae211f4","expr":"keys.length >= 0","rationale":"The keys array length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.259820740Z"}
