{"id":"d8a40a5d-f833-425c-bfce-ae23abcf3f1f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an AnnotationVisitor created via AnnotationWriter.create, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.285072022Z"}
