{"id":"020de6ae-dc37-42f5-8ae4-33449b2b0604","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() > 0","rationale":"debug is either null or a non-empty string providing debug information.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.578978795Z"}
{"id":"be6477d6-4dda-49c6-bca7-0a47561627db","expr":"source != null || debug == null","rationale":"debug is null if source is null, implying debug info exists only if source exists.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.578978795Z"}
