{"id":"bc4b00e1-eee3-45bb-90bb-4c0166d47375","expr":"(name == null) || (descriptor != null)","rationale":"When 'name' is non-null, it typically represents a method name, which should be accompanied by a non-null descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.590863972Z"}
