{"id":"096518cb-2ad2-4ad6-a93c-09627e229289","expr":"(name == null) || (!name.isEmpty())","rationale":"A valid method name, if provided, should not be an empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.590863972Z"}
