{"id":"623330b6-b84e-4f63-972d-6755f2785eca","expr":"permittedSubclass != null && !permittedSubclass.isEmpty()","rationale":"The permittedSubclass parameter typically represents a class name, which is expected to be a non-null, non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.601306172Z"}
{"id":"a8d11eed-e47c-47f4-b7da-73e08b1eb981","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, field names are valid non-empty strings in class visitor context.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.606384694Z"}
