{"id":"ddd7715b-11bd-4dc0-9cbc-c289f03d4495","expr":"(access & (1 << 0)) == 0 || (access & (1 << 0)) != 0","rationale":"Access is a bitmask of modifier flags, so specific bits may or may not be set, which is covered trivially.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.606384694Z"}
{"id":"3f918102-6262-4c27-a1fc-186ff9489852","expr":"value == null || value.getClass().getName() != null","rationale":"value can be null or some object representing field initial value, so its class name is non-null if non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.606384694Z"}
