{"id":"a7e64875-fb67-41d2-a51c-add4007b2853","expr":"name != null && (innerName != null || outerName != null)","rationale":"If name is non-null, then at least one of innerName or outerName should be non-null to represent an inner class properly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.603127682Z"}
