{"id":"dbc74f63-f4ec-4538-991b-a3a2dac89bf1","expr":"Character.isJavaIdentifierStart(permittedSubclass.charAt(0))","rationale":"Since permittedSubclass represents a class name, its first character should be a valid Java identifier start character.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.601306172Z"}
