{"id":"1508bf17-a251-48e8-9e92-fd2be553892a","expr":"permittedSubclass.indexOf('/') == -1","rationale":"This may or may not apply depending on usage, but an invariant might be that the permittedSubclass does not contain slashes if only simple names allowed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.601306172Z"}
