{"id":"b70bf719-360e-4490-9b0e-27226603b9cf","expr":"constructor != null && constructor.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"The constructor parameter is expected to be non-null and have a valid parameter count, as getConstructorDescriptor would rely on valid constructor info.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.627160249Z"}
