{"id":"49109c63-fcba-4da3-b34d-916239f53f55","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"A Method object always belongs to a declaring class, relevant for descriptor generation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.629880932Z"}
