{"id":"3c9480b0-5fda-414f-b5de-0f638a971d75","expr":"result.getSort() != 0","rationale":"The returned Type should have a valid sort value (non-zero) indicating a meaningful type kind.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getElementType():Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.642947302Z"}
{"id":"1a4dc101-92d9-4198-be22-fbf96a6cad2b","expr":"result.getDimensions() == 0","rationale":"getElementType should return the base element type with zero dimensions (non-array type).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getElementType():Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.642947302Z"}
