{"id":"80ef06a4-fac1-40ab-bc76-9c95e6f50826","expr":"methodDescriptor.contains(\")\")","rationale":"Method descriptor strings must include a closing parenthesis to denote end of argument list.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.645267721Z"}
