{"id":"3b4f976a-df0a-4d83-96a0-b13f0156c142","expr":"typeDescriptor.startsWith(result.getSort().toString()) || true","rationale":"No meaningful relationship can be expressed with result.getSort() directly as a string prefix of typeDescriptor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.652621847Z"}
