{"id":"012771ad-6e59-4397-bd00-673c970832d3","expr":"argumentTypes == null || argumentTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"Array lengths are always zero or positive if argumentTypes is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodType(Type,Type):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.656732146Z"}
{"id":"dae41ab3-73e8-4b24-aee4-ab8f8ab0a317","expr":"argumentTypes == null || (argumentTypes.length == 0 || argumentTypes[0] != null)","rationale":"Method expects non-null types in argumentTypes if present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodType(Type,Type):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.656732146Z"}
{"id":"74ffb540-8348-4602-b711-a840d6321545","expr":"returnType == null || returnType.getSort() >= 0","rationale":"returnType has a valid sort category if non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodType(Type,Type):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.656732146Z"}
{"id":"65def457-7ea3-4ea6-96b7-7f011c79235a","expr":"result.getSort() == 11","rationale":"The result type represents a method type in asm framework, which has sort code 11.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodType(Type,Type):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.657841334Z"}
{"id":"aa5e4888-e99e-4089-8629-ba149583400e","expr":"result.getReturnType().equals(returnType)","rationale":"The method type returned by getMethodType has the specified returnType as its return type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodType(Type,Type):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.657841334Z"}
{"id":"c1fd9405-d103-46fd-a8c2-8d5d713825d7","expr":"result.getArgumentTypes().length == argumentTypes.length","rationale":"The method type's argument types count matches the input argumentTypes array length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodType(Type,Type):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.657841334Z"}
{"id":"de8d9c07-445a-4b24-aafb-b5de3fb3bb9c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an array of Type objects representing argument types, so the result is expected to be a non-null array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes():Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.659646703Z"}
{"id":"b176e884-d9b0-4f04-a2ca-e3fb43002319","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"Arrays in Java always have a non-negative length; result represents argument types so length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes():Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.659646703Z"}
{"id":"0df45988-e17f-495c-970e-55bc6b5920c9","expr":"methodDescriptor != null && methodDescriptor.startsWith(\"(\") && methodDescriptor.contains(\")\")","rationale":"The methodDescriptor argument must be a non-null string representing a JVM method signature, which always starts with '(' and contains ')'.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(String):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.660156012Z"}
{"id":"81add1da-458c-4274-9253-935c8ae8edcd","expr":"methodDescriptor.length() >= 2","rationale":"Valid method descriptors contain at least opening and closing parentheses for argument types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(String):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.660156012Z"}
{"id":"950f136f-fd6b-4607-b385-d86c58fdc88d","expr":"methodDescriptor.charAt(0) == '('","rationale":"Ensures the method descriptor string starts with the '(' character as per JVM spec.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(String):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.660156012Z"}
{"id":"f050decd-26e5-4084-b990-564428e2720a","expr":"methodDescriptor.indexOf(')') > 0","rationale":"The method descriptor must contain a ')' character to terminate the argument list.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(String):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.660156012Z"}
{"id":"9a76e3f9-5112-4493-b742-4805d83a7792","expr":"!methodDescriptor.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Valid method descriptors do not contain whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(String):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.660156012Z"}
{"id":"9fccf2cb-60b9-4020-b733-cdc769fab0d3","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method allocates and returns a new array, so it cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(String):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.661287633Z"}
{"id":"cbd305fa-d4b0-4744-94c8-c26e20514066","expr":"result.getDescriptor().equals(methodDescriptor)","rationale":"result is constructed using the provided methodDescriptor, so their descriptors should be equal.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.665199959Z"}
{"id":"5eb56dfa-bddc-4aaf-b956-30fe3f746e5f","expr":"result.getStart() == 0","rationale":"The start index of the returned Type is always zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.665199959Z"}
{"id":"7f5f93bf-7069-403e-9053-ab6d6bdf6c4c","expr":"result.getEnd() == methodDescriptor.length()","rationale":"The end index of result equals the length of methodDescriptor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.665199959Z"}
{"id":"82789e07-0a74-41b9-a5d1-f9b0357b6d1e","expr":"result.length == method.getParameterTypes().length","rationale":"getArgumentTypes creates an array matching the method's parameter types length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.673710291Z"}
{"id":"0dc036ec-e44b-4481-b737-f612b31a5f8a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The result array is newly created and returned.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.673710291Z"}
{"id":"b64abb98-8d13-4cac-945c-7634cdf6704b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method getReturnType is expected to always return a valid Type instance representing the return type in the descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType():Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.673975841Z"}
{"id":"4dc42890-22d7-4a47-97dc-b1ecaa08661e","expr":"methodDescriptor != null && !methodDescriptor.isEmpty() && methodDescriptor.startsWith(\"(\") && methodDescriptor.contains(\")\")","rationale":"methodDescriptor is a valid JVM method descriptor string that must start with '(' and contain ')' separating the parameter types from the return type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.675544084Z"}
{"id":"8f4f977e-24cb-47f8-b4c5-74d809615a11","expr":"methodDescriptor.indexOf(')') < methodDescriptor.length() - 1","rationale":"There must be a return type descriptor after the closing parenthesis in the method descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.675544084Z"}
{"id":"1192c291-7f7c-4db7-b3a9-912b0c415e33","expr":"methodDescriptor.indexOf(')') >= 1","rationale":"The method descriptor contains parameter descriptors (or empty) before the closing parenthesis.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.675544084Z"}
{"id":"5e504565-46b9-4c67-b757-6a4bc235019f","expr":"methodDescriptor.length() > 2","rationale":"Method descriptor length is greater than 2, since at minimum it includes '()' and return type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.675544084Z"}
{"id":"117106e2-eafe-4a3d-967b-10ee39e412be","expr":"methodDescriptor.charAt(methodDescriptor.indexOf(')') + 1) != '('","rationale":"The return type descriptor should follow the closing parenthesis and should not be '(' itself.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.675544084Z"}
{"id":"66245d17-06c2-4370-ab2b-3034a87aac1e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a valid Type object representing the return type, never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.676180071Z"}
{"id":"7d03eac8-6e28-426d-aab0-153716094b0a","expr":"result.getDescriptor().length() <= methodDescriptor.length()","rationale":"The return type descriptor length cannot exceed the whole method descriptor length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.676180071Z"}
{"id":"4fc4de7f-b04a-4b98-8515-d9505757e6f6","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter is expected to be non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.676891501Z"}
{"id":"3c01c88f-f6fa-4e88-b1ab-d3341db0fd35","expr":"method.getReturnType().isArray() || !method.getReturnType().isArray()","rationale":"The return type of the method can be any type including arrays; this expression verifies safe evaluation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.676891501Z"}
{"id":"78a52c63-e900-4b09-b3e1-5ec3ea644c0a","expr":"method.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"Since getReturnType() returns a Class object for the method's return, it cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.676891501Z"}
{"id":"81f1568b-9ef1-4429-80df-49efe59535a8","expr":"method.getReturnType().isPrimitive() || !method.getReturnType().isPrimitive()","rationale":"The return type can be a primitive or a reference type; expression ensures safe evaluation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.676891501Z"}
{"id":"9037dfa4-02a0-4a92-92db-bef5b39ebf67","expr":"method.getReturnType().getName() != null","rationale":"All Class objects have non-null names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.676891501Z"}
{"id":"888ae612-6210-4a34-b304-e90a0b3c320c","expr":"method != null && method.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"Since getArgumentTypes uses method.getParameterTypes(), method and its returned array must not be null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.680977313Z"}
{"id":"ef911572-f7ce-4996-825a-608beab87b6c","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"The length of parameter types array must be non-negative as it represents the number of parameter types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.680977313Z"}
{"id":"aeafe22d-497b-4f43-9c7f-6d0432646b39","expr":"method.getParameterTypes() == method.getParameterTypes()","rationale":"The method's getParameterTypes() call should return same array reference at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.680977313Z"}
{"id":"c94f2797-0401-434b-a6ea-37aa91ac2cd6","expr":"methodDescriptor != null && methodDescriptor.length() > 0 && methodDescriptor.charAt(0) == '('","rationale":"The code assumes the methodDescriptor starts with '(' character at index 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnTypeOffset(String):int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.688867809Z"}
{"id":"8243ad70-6c04-46fa-9dd7-bf2d68246127","expr":"methodDescriptor.indexOf(')') > 0","rationale":"The while loop reads characters until it finds ')', which must be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnTypeOffset(String):int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.688867809Z"}
{"id":"95d24d7e-62d3-40bd-adec-b3d4374cc74c","expr":"methodDescriptor.length() > 1","rationale":"The method accesses methodDescriptor.charAt(1) initially, so length must exceed 1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnTypeOffset(String):int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.688867809Z"}
{"id":"8468e991-e3f4-4205-b325-e0cbe01f20a6","expr":"methodDescriptor.charAt(methodDescriptor.length() - 1) == ')'","rationale":"The ')' character marks the end of argument descriptors before the return type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnTypeOffset(String):int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.688867809Z"}
{"id":"1e7733f4-dab9-4cca-af81-59b9219adc43","expr":"descriptorBegin >= 0 && descriptorBegin < descriptorBuffer.length()","rationale":"descriptorBegin must be a valid index into descriptorBuffer for charAt to not throw.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getTypeInternal(String,int,int):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.689675690Z"}
{"id":"9460c924-fa1d-4a2a-9d81-6e4f5a17c57f","expr":"descriptorEnd > descriptorBegin","rationale":"The substring defined by descriptorBegin and descriptorEnd should be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getTypeInternal(String,int,int):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.689675690Z"}
{"id":"7d52a535-a843-4f72-b0f3-c28020f056ba","expr":"descriptorEnd <= descriptorBuffer.length()","rationale":"descriptorEnd must not exceed the length of the descriptorBuffer string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getTypeInternal(String,int,int):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.689675690Z"}
{"id":"64a6f17f-cc37-468c-9a1f-9e089b1df5d4","expr":"result > 0","rationale":"The computation starts at 1 and moves forward in the descriptor string, so the result should always be positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnTypeOffset(String):int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.690457222Z"}
{"id":"e90dd4ac-89b5-4a6c-b7e7-a088ab8a7e59","expr":"result <= methodDescriptor.length()","rationale":"The method returns an index offset that should not exceed the descriptor string length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnTypeOffset(String):int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.690457222Z"}
{"id":"7ca57baf-9a68-494f-aaa5-f571e0fa2cdf","expr":"methodDescriptor.charAt(result - 1) == ')'","rationale":"The offset returned marks the position just after the closing parenthesis in the method descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnTypeOffset(String):int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.690457222Z"}
{"id":"bc3685e2-9349-4e6f-b3f3-ab63e89b7ebe","expr":"result != null","rationale":"No null returns are possible according to the switch structure and returned objects.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getTypeInternal(String,int,int):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.691620031Z"}
{"id":"cde241be-278c-4a1a-b1ad-a4eacc48bbd0","expr":"result.getDescriptor().equals(descriptorBuffer.substring(descriptorBegin, descriptorEnd))","rationale":"The returned Type corresponds exactly to the substring defining that type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getTypeInternal(String,int,int):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.691620031Z"}
{"id":"3a1c3555-8840-40b7-9f65-c936d82e943a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns non-null strings for all type sorts.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getClassName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.692880454Z"}
{"id":"2c32c9ea-bcdb-4e40-a1ad-f57ff3ff1f7f","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"All return strings are non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getClassName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.692880454Z"}
{"id":"15ec6240-c588-409e-b06d-33f9181ab8b4","expr":"!result.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Class names or primitive names do not contain spaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getClassName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.692880454Z"}
{"id":"be9d9c1a-fb2f-4975-aa48-442176a5dafe","expr":"result.indexOf('[') == -1 || result.endsWith(\"[]\")","rationale":"Array types represent dimensions with \"[]\" suffixes, and non-array types do not contain '['.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getClassName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.692880454Z"}
{"id":"4de93e7c-0e48-43cd-818e-a3c12b7648df","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method getType returns a non-null Type object, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.694365650Z"}
{"id":"b0ddd63a-3a5f-4ecd-9798-5b06512116b1","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned substring is never null, it throws exceptions instead.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.705053593Z"}
{"id":"90b93c10-b84e-4130-873b-e6fb17396ba9","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"The substring is expected to produce a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.705053593Z"}
{"id":"bcff5a9d-da23-4f1a-a97b-30091d0eeb5d","expr":"result.indexOf('/') >= 0","rationale":"Internal names contain '/' characters separating package components.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.705053593Z"}
{"id":"33bfbe51-d3ee-4fd1-9116-d63673bb27c4","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Method getInternalName requires a non-null clazz parameter to operate.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.705573051Z"}
{"id":"ebed83f5-6ecf-440e-8566-6ff237128ccc","expr":"clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"The getName() method of Class always returns a non-null string representing the class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.705573051Z"}
{"id":"04221481-fcc0-4e1f-9810-270ac1cb6bc7","expr":"clazz.getName().contains(\".\") || !clazz.getName().contains(\"/\")","rationale":"Java class names returned by getName contain dots ('.') separating package names and class names, and do not contain '/'.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.705573051Z"}
{"id":"4dde1e69-85d6-4f38-8cd8-a420435334c6","expr":"clazz.getName().equals(clazz.getName().replace('.', '/').replace('/', '/'))","rationale":"Replacing '.' with '/' does not affect existing '/' characters, hence replacing '/' with '/' afterwards does nothing.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.705573051Z"}
{"id":"be8a71a1-e01e-4bc4-a468-894a44bed0a5","expr":"!clazz.getName().startsWith(\"/\")","rationale":"Class name strings do not start with '/' prior to transformation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.705573051Z"}
{"id":"6bb50827-2d48-40e5-94e9-fecc9bd90cdd","expr":"result.equals(clazz.getName().replace('.', '/'))","rationale":"The method returns clazz.getName().replace('.', '/') so result must equal this expression.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:17.706474278Z"}
