{"id":"8855c9c9-4af8-44e9-940a-07c5df8aa226","expr":"label.position >= 0 || label.position == -1","rationale":"By assumption, label.position if accessible, is either -1 or a non-negative integer indicating bytecode offset.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.850844095Z"}
{"id":"b3c5e392-5c45-4567-aaca-c4d05e6904a7","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The label parameter is expected to be non-null since the method visits it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.850944924Z"}
{"id":"2a8717dd-ccf0-42e2-ab18-be4e438434a8","expr":"!((opcode >= 167 && opcode <= 168) || (opcode >= 198 && opcode <= 199)) || label.isResolved()","rationale":"If opcode is a jump instruction that must have a resolved label, then label.isResolved() must be true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.850844095Z"}
{"id":"2f99da2c-6e77-48d9-852c-a844bfe0c619","expr":"label != null","rationale":"label must be non-null because it is used as an argument to the mv.visitLabel method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.851399310Z"}
{"id":"3674399b-9b91-4e4c-8943-a538b23665a3","expr":"label.getOffset() >= 0","rationale":"Label offset is non-negative consistent with a valid Label representing a code position.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.851399310Z"}
{"id":"2ffbb006-073a-4da5-b128-02e23451a761","expr":"varIndex >= 0","rationale":"The variable index that identifies a local variable is usually non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.861253894Z"}
{"id":"c4f7ca68-f9af-44e0-959d-32b752cd871b","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"An increment instruction generally involves a non-zero increment to have effect.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.861253894Z"}
{"id":"40283dfc-386b-4488-8a91-1b0f60726693","expr":"Math.abs(increment) <= Short.MAX_VALUE","rationale":"The increment value often fits in a certain range (e.g., a short) for bytecode instructions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.861253894Z"}
{"id":"1af5a933-477d-46ff-8f19-a48b7d8099d0","expr":"varIndex < 256","rationale":"Variable indexes must fit in a single byte index according to JVM constraints.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.861253894Z"}
{"id":"9a08a639-aa8c-4604-8a7b-e96010873db6","expr":"increment == 1 || increment == -1","rationale":"Common case increments for iinc instructions are usually +-1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.861253894Z"}
{"id":"94de888d-31b6-48c3-9bc7-7f169611bc60","expr":"max >= min","rationale":"The table switch instruction requires max to be greater or equal to min.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.862170429Z"}
{"id":"875cd1c7-7ae4-47fc-94c4-e0dbc534a072","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"Labels array represents possible jump destinations and must be initialized.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.862170429Z"}
{"id":"7556ee32-e654-427f-9898-91786d1fd3d4","expr":"labels.length == (max - min + 1)","rationale":"Number of labels corresponds exactly to the switch's case count.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.862170429Z"}
{"id":"8868c1f0-4b1e-4b3c-8a4c-ae98480a9d8b","expr":"varIndex >= 0","rationale":"Local variable indexes are non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.862187010Z"}
{"id":"ea8e93fb-0fc8-471d-a241-3a0fe63652d6","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"VisitIincInsn usually increments the variable by a non-zero amount.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.862187010Z"}
{"id":"fff21414-6a96-438e-ae17-187a946ec5c6","expr":"varIndex <= 65535","rationale":"varIndex is bounded by the JVM local variable range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.862187010Z"}
{"id":"e492b7f5-ede9-459e-9f46-d64f6e0cdce2","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"Default label acts as fallback target for the switch operation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.862170429Z"}
{"id":"df4fcfa7-2f73-4387-bf6d-3b185cdabb95","expr":"increment >= -32768 && increment <= 32767","rationale":"increment must be within the valid short range for the iinc instruction.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.862187010Z"}
{"id":"a5c7af63-f195-48dc-8fff-cacfa8002715","expr":"keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"The keys array and labels array should have the same length because each key corresponds to a label in the lookup switch instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.862983741Z"}
