{"id":"9f7f8794-5c92-4661-9dff-08353ae0297e","expr":"keys.length >= 1","rationale":"The keys and labels arrays should have at least one entry to make sense as a lookup switch.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.862983741Z"}
{"id":"589883a2-3d77-40b4-a5a0-239013535987","expr":"labels.length >= 1","rationale":"The labels array should have at least one element corresponding to the keys.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.862983741Z"}
{"id":"8b2771fb-c528-4e4f-81e6-1768612edcc1","expr":"keys != null && labels != null","rationale":"Null arrays for keys or labels would be invalid in this context.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:19.862983741Z"}
