{"id":"93072718-3267-41c0-a340-03723505cc8c","expr":"result.getInstantiatedClass().equals(clazz)","rationale":"The returned ObjectInstantiator should create instances of the input clazz, so the InstantiatedClass matches clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#getInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:20.073815154Z"}
{"id":"637d256b-788a-4e47-9db4-e6a21dfb8cf5","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Since the method is called with a Class<T> parameter, it is generally non-null to identify the type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#newInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:20.074227029Z"}
{"id":"095caeed-169b-47c8-9128-901f428b2dc9","expr":"clazz.isInterface() == false","rationale":"ObjectInstantiator creation usually requires a concrete class, not an interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#newInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:20.074227029Z"}
{"id":"55db0cdb-e4e1-4f37-9a40-cc79d4bf3f6b","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"Instantiators for primitive types are typically not supported.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#newInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:20.074227029Z"}
{"id":"7ea48a4d-fced-4dc1-8798-10b97063579f","expr":"clazz.getClassLoader() != null","rationale":"Most user-defined classes have a non-null ClassLoader; useful for instantiating.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#newInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:20.074227029Z"}
{"id":"8c3cb4e9-8c8a-4f5b-8efd-2bd5308b2b14","expr":"!clazz.isArray()","rationale":"Instantiation strategies usually differ for arrays; this method handles non-array classes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#newInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:20.074227029Z"}
{"id":"6e9f31ba-5b5b-4887-a08b-1bd334491fb9","expr":"result != null && clazz != null && result.getInstantiatorClass().isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"The returned ObjectInstantiator must not be null and must be compatible with the clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#newInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:20.074821158Z"}
{"id":"6d7619e0-ead8-4b1f-ba18-a66571e33328","expr":"(result == null) == (clazz == null)","rationale":"Instantiator existence corresponds to clazz non-nullness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#newInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:20.074821158Z"}
{"id":"24c2e022-d0cf-40ca-b98b-5e8095967a1b","expr":"result.getInstantiatorClass() != null","rationale":"The ObjectInstantiator should provide a class for what it instantiates.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#newInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:20.074821158Z"}
{"id":"c025208e-0a95-4734-aa73-2d0bf1565c7d","expr":"!result.getInstantiatorClass().isInterface()","rationale":"The instantiator class should not be an interface.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#newInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:20.074821158Z"}
{"id":"4fc83496-f266-46b8-a6a0-1d82cdabf06e","expr":"!result.getInstantiatorClass().isPrimitive()","rationale":"The instantiator class should not be a primitive type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#newInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:23:20.074821158Z"}
